(5223098, 759837, 46336, '<td valign="top">Nice - I can''t put my fingure on how you managed it, but this <i>does</i> convey silence (and is beautiful). Well done.</td>', 'Nice - I can''t put my fingure on how you managed it, but this does convey silence (and is beautiful). Well done.', '2009-01-28 00:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223099, 760418, 82690, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo. I feel that this would be an excellent photo if maybe instead of her left arm being over the neck it just had it extend out toward the camera. IMO</td>', 'This is a nice photo. I feel that this would be an excellent photo if maybe instead of her left arm being over the neck it just had it extend out toward the camera. IMO', '2009-01-28 00:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223108, 759221, 3569, '<td valign="top">nice long-legged fly</td>', 'nice long-legged fly', '2009-01-28 00:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223118, 759636, 96881, '<td valign="top">I am not sure that black and white processing suits this photo.  There is so much detail in it that i feel has been lost as the different colours (but similar tones) merge into one.  The higlights are too blown out which means detail has been lost.<br/>I like the idea of the fallen tree and the ever present question however</td>', 'I am not sure that black and white processing suits this photo.  There is so much detail in it that i feel has been lost as the different colours (but similar tones) merge into one.  The higlights are too blown out which means detail has been lost.I like the idea of the fallen tree and the ever present question however', '2009-01-28 00:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223127, 759175, 82690, '<td valign="top">This shot is lovely. I like the guy in the background, and the whole set up, it allows my imagination to run wild. Also because there''s writing on the tape I am very interested in what is written on it; Im assuming it says don''t tell anyone, but Im not too sure. It kind of seems to take away. All in all, fabulous photo, good luck</td>', 'This shot is lovely. I like the guy in the background, and the whole set up, it allows my imagination to run wild. Also because there''s writing on the tape I am very interested in what is written on it; Im assuming it says don''t tell anyone, but Im not too sure. It kind of seems to take away. All in all, fabulous photo, good luck', '2009-01-28 00:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223128, 760383, 96881, '<td valign="top">The overexposed nature of the left hand side of the photo, in contrast to the right hand side, causes problems.  I don''t know if the tricky lighting lead you to choose black and white or not, but it does work with the girl for the most part.  I feel the crop is too close to her head, making the photo feel cramped.  I also am not sure about the choice of the border.  A square crop can be very effective, and the large white spaces i don''t think add anything to the photo, and on the left, ephasise the large overexposed area</td>', 'The overexposed nature of the left hand side of the photo, in contrast to the right hand side, causes problems.  I don''t know if the tricky lighting lead you to choose black and white or not, but it does work with the girl for the most part.  I feel the crop is too close to her head, making the photo feel cramped.  I also am not sure about the choice of the border.  A square crop can be very effective, and the large white spaces i don''t think add anything to the photo, and on the left, ephasise the large overexposed area', '2009-01-28 00:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223129, 760385, 99394, '<td valign="top">I''m hoping this was staged and you seriously didnt walk up on someone sitting on the sidewalk like this lol.</td>', 'I''m hoping this was staged and you seriously didnt walk up on someone sitting on the sidewalk like this lol.', '2009-01-28 00:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223131, 760266, 82690, '<td valign="top">The idea seems that it could have potential; however, it could have been a much better shot IMO.</td>', 'The idea seems that it could have potential; however, it could have been a much better shot IMO.', '2009-01-28 00:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223133, 760115, 46336, '<td valign="top">''Walk, don''t Talk'' would have worked better. <br/>Nonetheless, I do like this - there is soemthing quirky about it (what are they doing there anyway) that really does help convey silence. 7.</td>', '''Walk, don''t Talk'' would have worked better. Nonetheless, I do like this - there is soemthing quirky about it (what are they doing there anyway) that really does help convey silence. 7.', '2009-01-28 00:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223140, 759539, 46336, '<td valign="top">An excellent ieda for the challenge, and engaging composition. I can''t help think that brighter, with more contrast would have made a more powerful image.</td>', 'An excellent ieda for the challenge, and engaging composition. I can''t help think that brighter, with more contrast would have made a more powerful image.', '2009-01-28 00:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223143, 758419, 82690, '<td valign="top">The background is a bit too distracting. I just don''t see anything too special about this photo IMO.</td>', 'The background is a bit too distracting. I just don''t see anything too special about this photo IMO.', '2009-01-28 00:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223144, 760374, 96881, '<td valign="top">Not sure how this photo fits in with the Silence topic in this case, nor does the title help bring in the relevance of the photo.<br/> <br/>The shallow depth of field, with the focus point then in the centre of the photo, means a very large area covering half the photo is very out of focus and not adding to the image.  Having the front of the flower in the lower right corner wouldd then mean much of the picture would be the flower as it moves away and gets further out of focus.</td>', 'Not sure how this photo fits in with the Silence topic in this case, nor does the title help bring in the relevance of the photo. The shallow depth of field, with the focus point then in the centre of the photo, means a very large area covering half the photo is very out of focus and not adding to the image.  Having the front of the flower in the lower right corner wouldd then mean much of the picture would be the flower as it moves away and gets further out of focus.', '2009-01-28 00:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223155, 759353, 96881, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, the colours in the water, being gold/brown, are unappealing to me.  With them making up much of the shot, I feel they need to be more appealing to make the overall photo here.  The bird is very small (too small for my liking) and I am not sure if it is in focus either.</td>', 'Unfortunately, the colours in the water, being gold/brown, are unappealing to me.  With them making up much of the shot, I feel they need to be more appealing to make the overall photo here.  The bird is very small (too small for my liking) and I am not sure if it is in focus either.', '2009-01-28 00:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223156, 759738, 46336, '<td valign="top">Great concept - no doubt that you have effectively conveyed silence. This idea has been done so well recently - see Best of 2008, so you may be marked down a bit. A little soft for my taste.</td>', 'Great concept - no doubt that you have effectively conveyed silence. This idea has been done so well recently - see Best of 2008, so you may be marked down a bit. A little soft for my taste.', '2009-01-28 00:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223160, 760146, 82690, '<td valign="top">Very nice, very nice.</td>', 'Very nice, very nice.', '2009-01-28 00:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223165, 760036, 82690, '<td valign="top">The idea is good and I like the grimy feel to it. However, I get distracted by the blurry light towards the end. Also I think if those lights in the back could''ve been off that it would be a nicer shot. BTW I love the open locker (:</td>', 'The idea is good and I like the grimy feel to it. However, I get distracted by the blurry light towards the end. Also I think if those lights in the back could''ve been off that it would be a nicer shot. BTW I love the open locker (:', '2009-01-28 00:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223169, 760152, 46336, '<td valign="top">Yes. This works - quite calming, in fact. Thanks.</td>', 'Yes. This works - quite calming, in fact. Thanks.', '2009-01-28 00:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223173, 760410, 82690, '<td valign="top">There just seems to be nothing too special about this shot for me.</td>', 'There just seems to be nothing too special about this shot for me.', '2009-01-28 00:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223184, 759634, 82690, '<td valign="top">Creative, I like it. I would like it so much better though if the top of the neck wasn''t out of the shot.</td>', 'Creative, I like it. I would like it so much better though if the top of the neck wasn''t out of the shot.', '2009-01-28 00:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223188, 760356, 82690, '<td valign="top">The feel to this is very sweet. Good shot and good luck (:</td>', 'The feel to this is very sweet. Good shot and good luck (:', '2009-01-28 00:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223194, 760340, 46336, '<td valign="top">Probably the most powerful of this interpretation. Well done.</td>', 'Probably the most powerful of this interpretation. Well done.', '2009-01-28 00:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223195, 759382, 82690, '<td valign="top">Very lovely shot. That little speck below the eye is bugging me though just a little OCD part of me haha, but besides that its a very nice shot.</td>', 'Very lovely shot. That little speck below the eye is bugging me though just a little OCD part of me haha, but besides that its a very nice shot.', '2009-01-28 00:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223204, 760286, 96881, '<td valign="top">The idea for this photo is really good, however the entire image is out of focus.  I would have loved to see this, if possible, with the head sharp, and the hands slightly blurred  showing movement.  I feel that the shutter speed you used, based on the amount of motion blur from the hands, was too slow.  Slight blur on the hands would have worked better, and things like the Teeshirt showing through the hands would then have been avoided, and a much better chance of getting the face sharp, and avoiding movement of the shoulders.<br/>Also, the head is off centre.  I don''t think that works for this shot.  Having the head centred and the crop off the shouolders the same of both sides would also have helped the image......</td>', 'The idea for this photo is really good, however the entire image is out of focus.  I would have loved to see this, if possible, with the head sharp, and the hands slightly blurred  showing movement.  I feel that the shutter speed you used, based on the amount of motion blur from the hands, was too slow.  Slight blur on the hands would have worked better, and things like the Teeshirt showing through the hands would then have been avoided, and a much better chance of getting the face sharp, and avoiding movement of the shoulders.Also, the head is off centre.  I don''t think that works for this shot.  Having the head centred and the crop off the shouolders the same of both sides would also have helped the image......', '2009-01-28 00:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223214, 760170, 82690, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely shot; however, I feel like it would''ve done much better in the sound category IMO. Just with all the bright colors and lights it seems so loud and noisy you know? And when I think of cities, such as this one, I think of noise. But the photo itself is excellent, good job.</td>', 'This is a lovely shot; however, I feel like it would''ve done much better in the sound category IMO. Just with all the bright colors and lights it seems so loud and noisy you know? And when I think of cities, such as this one, I think of noise. But the photo itself is excellent, good job.', '2009-01-28 00:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223216, 759982, 96881, '<td valign="top">Nice, sharp, clear capture of an amazing bird.  The black background makes it jump out really well and suits the photo.<br/> <br/>However, I cannot see where this eagle, with a title of Strength, meets the Sinence challenge.........</td>', 'Nice, sharp, clear capture of an amazing bird.  The black background makes it jump out really well and suits the photo. However, I cannot see where this eagle, with a title of Strength, meets the Sinence challenge.........', '2009-01-28 00:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223219, 760324, 82690, '<td valign="top">wow, very lovely. Good job. The colors and the reflection is just fabulous (:</td>', 'wow, very lovely. Good job. The colors and the reflection is just fabulous (:', '2009-01-28 00:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223224, 759004, 82690, '<td valign="top">It''s just a bit too busy for my taste.</td>', 'It''s just a bit too busy for my taste.', '2009-01-28 00:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223227, 760344, 82690, '<td valign="top">The background is a bit distracting. IT would''ve been a lot better just the candle alone, IMO</td>', 'The background is a bit distracting. IT would''ve been a lot better just the candle alone, IMO', '2009-01-28 00:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223231, 760044, 82690, '<td valign="top">It''s lovely. However, I''m a bit flustered, your title says before the storm but with that little tree it seems like it was after, I''m thinking I''m wrong but idk. I do like the photo though, theres something special about it. Good job</td>', 'It''s lovely. However, I''m a bit flustered, your title says before the storm but with that little tree it seems like it was after, I''m thinking I''m wrong but idk. I do like the photo though, theres something special about it. Good job', '2009-01-28 00:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223235, 760451, 97284, '<td valign="top">absolutely amazing photo!  Great work!</td>', 'absolutely amazing photo!  Great work!', '2009-01-28 00:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223245, 759159, 82690, '<td valign="top">The shadows bother me. I feel that it should just have half of the face with the shadow covering, and only that.</td>', 'The shadows bother me. I feel that it should just have half of the face with the shadow covering, and only that.', '2009-01-28 01:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223250, 760356, 46336, '<td valign="top">Could be a winner. Wondermful feeling.</td>', 'Could be a winner. Wondermful feeling.', '2009-01-28 01:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223251, 760354, 82690, '<td valign="top">well well well doesn''t this model just seem oh so familiar. (: I like the idea; however the fact that the door line is not straight is killin me haha. Other than that, nice photo, good luck.</td>', 'well well well doesn''t this model just seem oh so familiar. (: I like the idea; however the fact that the door line is not straight is killin me haha. Other than that, nice photo, good luck.', '2009-01-28 01:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223252, 759539, 96881, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, meets the challenge really well.  Black and white works here, but also would have been interesting in colour with the green grass and grey stones.  The angle of the photo and the crop though are a little awkward.  Having this angle with the close crop on the left stone makes it look like maybe the image is not straight (however it is).  Also the cropping accross the other headstones across the back.  With this angle, having a couple more stones in the row might have helped, and from slightly lower that the stones behind could have remained in the image........</td>', 'I like the idea, meets the challenge really well.  Black and white works here, but also would have been interesting in colour with the green grass and grey stones.  The angle of the photo and the crop though are a little awkward.  Having this angle with the close crop on the left stone makes it look like maybe the image is not straight (however it is).  Also the cropping accross the other headstones across the back.  With this angle, having a couple more stones in the row might have helped, and from slightly lower that the stones behind could have remained in the image........', '2009-01-28 01:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223253, 759634, 97284, '<td valign="top">Awesome...meaning in the title...love it!</td>', 'Awesome...meaning in the title...love it!', '2009-01-28 01:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223258, 760013, 82690, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. However, I feel that it could be much more powerful with a bit of cropping.</td>', 'Nice shot. However, I feel that it could be much more powerful with a bit of cropping.', '2009-01-28 01:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223264, 760123, 82690, '<td valign="top">Sweet little Caelan. Lovely photo. I love the cropping in this and especially how she is slightly diagonal. Very nice (:</td>', 'Sweet little Caelan. Lovely photo. I love the cropping in this and especially how she is slightly diagonal. Very nice (:', '2009-01-28 01:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223301, 759407, 39429, '<td valign="top">I appreciate a different take on the photograph.  It''s interesting, but feels more like sound than silence to me.</td>', 'I appreciate a different take on the photograph.  It''s interesting, but feels more like sound than silence to me.', '2009-01-28 01:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223307, 760354, 96881, '<td valign="top">This image does not appeal to me at all.  Apart from the shock factor you are tryng to acheive (which rarely does well here), the post processing does not appeal to me at all.  The dark eye areas, the shadow under the chin, the hair loosing any detail in it......<br/> <br/>I expect you to get plenty of comments though..........</td>', 'This image does not appeal to me at all.  Apart from the shock factor you are tryng to acheive (which rarely does well here), the post processing does not appeal to me at all.  The dark eye areas, the shadow under the chin, the hair loosing any detail in it...... I expect you to get plenty of comments though..........', '2009-01-28 01:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5223308, 760034, 39429, '<td valign="top">This image captures me with the gritty realism of a crime shot image.  I think the processing adds to the grittiness.</td>', 'This image captures me with the gritty realism of a crime shot image.  I think the processing adds to the grittiness.', '2009-01-28 01:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
