(5223352, 759994, 100495, '<td valign="top">Everything in this image is beautiful, except the bottom left corner which is distracting.<br/> <br/>As a really minor point I think it would have looked better in a couple of minutes when the cloud shadows moved to different places. The shadow behind the immediate foreground accentuates the distracting corner.</td>', 'Everything in this image is beautiful, except the bottom left corner which is distracting. As a really minor point I think it would have looked better in a couple of minutes when the cloud shadows moved to different places. The shadow behind the immediate foreground accentuates the distracting corner.', '2009-01-28 01:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
