(5224037, 760221, 54446, '<td valign="top">I think this is very creative and unique.  Great idea.  Well presented.  One of my highest marked images.  The more I look at it, the more I like it.  10</td>', 'I think this is very creative and unique.  Great idea.  Well presented.  One of my highest marked images.  The more I look at it, the more I like it.  10', '2009-01-28 10:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
