(5224162, 760345, 84363, '<td valign="top">Highlights in the hair are over exposed.  The overall image seems to have a green tint or the green is over-saturated.</td>', 'Highlights in the hair are over exposed.  The overall image seems to have a green tint or the green is over-saturated.', '2009-01-28 11:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
