(5224230, 760387, 25313, '<td valign="top">Emotive! Sometimes you may find yourself in a position that may not be possible to get the perfect angle. Editorials are like that. If you only could have moved to your right to include the background figure more and moved the subjects closer this could have been a 10. It contains all elements for this challenge and technically perfect.</td>', 'Emotive! Sometimes you may find yourself in a position that may not be possible to get the perfect angle. Editorials are like that. If you only could have moved to your right to include the background figure more and moved the subjects closer this could have been a 10. It contains all elements for this challenge and technically perfect.', '2009-01-28 11:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
