(5224854, 759337, 102024, '<td valign="top">I like that you can tell where the ground is and the super shallow DOF definitely works with the image.  But I feel that the part of the pin that is out of focus is a little jarring, in a sense.  I realize the possible difficulty of trying to get a pin to fall within a shallow DOF, but still, I think it might have been interesting to try.</td>', 'I like that you can tell where the ground is and the super shallow DOF definitely works with the image.  But I feel that the part of the pin that is out of focus is a little jarring, in a sense.  I realize the possible difficulty of trying to get a pin to fall within a shallow DOF, but still, I think it might have been interesting to try.', '2009-01-28 17:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
