(5225153, 759367, 96881, '<td valign="top">Not the Title I would have put with this type of image, but I will ignore that<br/> <br/>The background headstones create clutter.  A shallower depth of field may have helped.  A different angle shooting the photo also could have been good, therefore removing the need to crop through headstones int he background.  Showing some sky, wither overcast or blue could have helped declutter the image.  I feel the crop is also too close all around, and the colours could have been better processed to get a better statement</td>', 'Not the Title I would have put with this type of image, but I will ignore that The background headstones create clutter.  A shallower depth of field may have helped.  A different angle shooting the photo also could have been good, therefore removing the need to crop through headstones int he background.  Showing some sky, wither overcast or blue could have helped declutter the image.  I feel the crop is also too close all around, and the colours could have been better processed to get a better statement', '2009-01-28 20:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
