(5225230, 760433, 82690, '<td valign="top">I think I would''ve liked this a lot better if it there wasnt the black foot showing, and only had the face not black. <br/>Its a lovely idea however.</td>', 'I think I would''ve liked this a lot better if it there wasnt the black foot showing, and only had the face not black. Its a lovely idea however.', '2009-01-28 21:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5225232, 760115, 82690, '<td valign="top">The bench is a bit distracting for me.</td>', 'The bench is a bit distracting for me.', '2009-01-28 21:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5225234, 759627, 82690, '<td valign="top">The background seems to have too much going on. Also it seems that there should be some cropping done, like towards the right corner.</td>', 'The background seems to have too much going on. Also it seems that there should be some cropping done, like towards the right corner.', '2009-01-28 21:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
