(5225239, 759161, 82690, '<td valign="top">This is nice, however I feel that if it was cropped maybe a half an inch more towards the bottom it would be much better due to the little gold necklace peaking out.</td>', 'This is nice, however I feel that if it was cropped maybe a half an inch more towards the bottom it would be much better due to the little gold necklace peaking out.', '2009-01-28 21:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5225241, 760057, 82690, '<td valign="top">The idea is nice, similar to what I wanted. However, the big glowing thing distracts me also although the music player says mute I think this would be much more powerful if it just wasn''t there.</td>', 'The idea is nice, similar to what I wanted. However, the big glowing thing distracts me also although the music player says mute I think this would be much more powerful if it just wasn''t there.', '2009-01-28 21:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5225244, 760235, 82690, '<td valign="top">This is very lovely, I feel that if it was cropped like an inch more, on the left side it would be ten times better. But Im kind of a cropping freak (X<br/>Very nice photo nonetheless. Good job.</td>', 'This is very lovely, I feel that if it was cropped like an inch more, on the left side it would be ten times better. But Im kind of a cropping freak (XVery nice photo nonetheless. Good job.', '2009-01-28 21:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5225247, 760221, 82690, '<td valign="top">This is great. I love the grungy feel to it all. Good job.</td>', 'This is great. I love the grungy feel to it all. Good job.', '2009-01-28 21:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5225250, 760179, 82690, '<td valign="top">Something looks a bit overdone, I just can''t put my finger on it. This just seems. Boring to me.</td>', 'Something looks a bit overdone, I just can''t put my finger on it. This just seems. Boring to me.', '2009-01-28 21:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5225256, 760236, 82690, '<td valign="top">The concept is great. I just don''t quite like how her pants blend into the background. Also I think if there was less shadowing on her face it would be nicer. After all yoga is all about finding the light, now isn''t it (:</td>', 'The concept is great. I just don''t quite like how her pants blend into the background. Also I think if there was less shadowing on her face it would be nicer. After all yoga is all about finding the light, now isn''t it (:', '2009-01-28 21:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5225257, 759096, 101838, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but those ark spots on the flower kill it. I''d try to refocus (w/ ex-tubes probably) so that they were less visible.</td>', 'Good idea, but those ark spots on the flower kill it. I''d try to refocus (w/ ex-tubes probably) so that they were less visible.', '2009-01-28 21:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5225258, 759319, 82690, '<td valign="top">It seems as if you could''ve made this look a lot more interesting.</td>', 'It seems as if you could''ve made this look a lot more interesting.', '2009-01-28 21:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5225261, 760342, 82690, '<td valign="top">Fabulous. One of my favorites. 9 for me  (:</td>', 'Fabulous. One of my favorites. 9 for me  (:', '2009-01-28 21:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5225263, 759722, 82690, '<td valign="top">I just don''t really get it. Yes no one is playing it, but its still an instrument made for, music, sound. Not so much silence IMO</td>', 'I just don''t really get it. Yes no one is playing it, but its still an instrument made for, music, sound. Not so much silence IMO', '2009-01-28 21:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5225264, 760286, 82690, '<td valign="top">I like how the hands are but I think this picture would be much more effective if he in total wasn''t blurry, just his hands.</td>', 'I like how the hands are but I think this picture would be much more effective if he in total wasn''t blurry, just his hands.', '2009-01-28 21:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
