(5225799, 759634, 101377, '<td valign="top">Nice concept.  Would upset me if it was my guitar though!</td>', 'Nice concept.  Would upset me if it was my guitar though!', '2009-01-29 09:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5225813, 760452, 103142, '<td valign="top">very nice. I originally thought that there was too much contrast, and too much detail lost in the trees, but actually, I think it works!</td>', 'very nice. I originally thought that there was too much contrast, and too much detail lost in the trees, but actually, I think it works!', '2009-01-29 09:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5225814, 759161, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like the breaking of the rules. Usually you leave more room on the left when the person is facing the left. but bringing it to the edge draws your eyes in to the flowing hair. <br/> <br/>Two <b></b>very<b></b> small issues: the wisp of hair showing on the left is distracting (extra fan to make sure it''s all blowing back since you can''t photoshop it?), and having her move the finger more to the left so that it''s centered more on the mouth. It''s a really small thing, but I liked this picture very much, but something bothered me the more I looked at it. So I thought you might be interested...<br/> <br/>very, very nice shot</td>', 'I like the breaking of the rules. Usually you leave more room on the left when the person is facing the left. but bringing it to the edge draws your eyes in to the flowing hair.  Two very small issues: the wisp of hair showing on the left is distracting (extra fan to make sure it''s all blowing back since you can''t photoshop it?), and having her move the finger more to the left so that it''s centered more on the mouth. It''s a really small thing, but I liked this picture very much, but something bothered me the more I looked at it. So I thought you might be interested... very, very nice shot', '2009-01-29 09:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5225815, 759063, 103142, '<td valign="top">Very well done. I marked it lower than some others simply because there are other photos that I like better, personally. But I wanted to let you know that I liked it very much. The only thing that bothered me was it seemed a little too centered. I''d be tempted to have the main image down in the lower left and have more counter (or whatever your background is) on the left.<br/> <br/>thanks!</td>', 'Very well done. I marked it lower than some others simply because there are other photos that I like better, personally. But I wanted to let you know that I liked it very much. The only thing that bothered me was it seemed a little too centered. I''d be tempted to have the main image down in the lower left and have more counter (or whatever your background is) on the left. thanks!', '2009-01-29 09:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5225816, 760128, 103142, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea. Two suggestions: the bench in the background being directly above the horse is disconcerting. A different angle that moves it to the right or left would help.<br/> <br/>Also, I think it''s a tad dark. I''d play with the levels a little and lighten the highlights. It''s not that important to have the details in the snow, and you wouldn''t lose anything from the horse.<br/> <br/>great idea!</td>', 'Very nice idea. Two suggestions: the bench in the background being directly above the horse is disconcerting. A different angle that moves it to the right or left would help. Also, I think it''s a tad dark. I''d play with the levels a little and lighten the highlights. It''s not that important to have the details in the snow, and you wouldn''t lose anything from the horse. great idea!', '2009-01-29 09:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5225958, 760221, 71489, '<td valign="top">Sheer brilliance!..perfect 10..great colour tone</td>', 'Sheer brilliance!..perfect 10..great colour tone', '2009-01-29 11:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5225996, 760452, 11920, '<td valign="top">I would like to see this entry win...10</td>', 'I would like to see this entry win...10', '2009-01-29 12:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226017, 759994, 102024, '<td valign="top">Greens look a little over done.</td>', 'Greens look a little over done.', '2009-01-29 12:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226019, 760126, 102024, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection of the ringflash.  Whites are pretty blown out.</td>', 'Nice reflection of the ringflash.  Whites are pretty blown out.', '2009-01-29 12:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226021, 759063, 102024, '<td valign="top">Haha, well executed!</td>', 'Haha, well executed!', '2009-01-29 12:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226024, 759978, 102024, '<td valign="top">I like the idea.  Composition-wise it does have a sense of flow, but it''s still sort of erratic and busy.  Easy for the eye to get lost.</td>', 'I like the idea.  Composition-wise it does have a sense of flow, but it''s still sort of erratic and busy.  Easy for the eye to get lost.', '2009-01-29 12:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226041, 759785, 63269, '<td valign="top">I would suggest adding a little more contrast to this, it almost looks just a tad underexposed. The deep blue tones do give a very nice sense of silence and peace here, though.</td>', 'I would suggest adding a little more contrast to this, it almost looks just a tad underexposed. The deep blue tones do give a very nice sense of silence and peace here, though.', '2009-01-29 12:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226046, 760088, 63269, '<td valign="top">I might suggest a different angle and a different composition, but the colors and focus are nice.</td>', 'I might suggest a different angle and a different composition, but the colors and focus are nice.', '2009-01-29 12:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226050, 760372, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love the composition, the moody lighting and somber colors - awesome work!</td>', 'I love the composition, the moody lighting and somber colors - awesome work!', '2009-01-29 12:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226058, 758418, 63269, '<td valign="top">To my eyes, you''ve captured something here - something can''t quite put my finger on - that really evokes a sense of stillness and quiet. And I love i when a photo fits the challenge in such subtle ways. Bravo!</td>', 'To my eyes, you''ve captured something here - something can''t quite put my finger on - that really evokes a sense of stillness and quiet. And I love i when a photo fits the challenge in such subtle ways. Bravo!', '2009-01-29 12:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226066, 759958, 63269, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the way the lighting has created a strange shadow in his right eye, but I otherwise I like the dramatic lighting, and the high contrast.</td>', 'I don''t like the way the lighting has created a strange shadow in his right eye, but I otherwise I like the dramatic lighting, and the high contrast.', '2009-01-29 13:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226068, 760363, 63269, '<td valign="top">Awesome lighting, perfect exposure, tones, focus, contrast, etc. This has got to be a winner. :)</td>', 'Awesome lighting, perfect exposure, tones, focus, contrast, etc. This has got to be a winner. :)', '2009-01-29 13:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226077, 760177, 63269, '<td valign="top">Neat concept, but the composition is weak and cluttered. I know from experience it''s difficult to shoot such objects though, especially when trying to work in their accessories, such as the film reels. Just as a thought, maybe you could place a person in the picture, and have him/her putting the film on the projector or something. Or just try using the rule of thirds, or play with some interesting angles... Hope this helps! :)</td>', 'Neat concept, but the composition is weak and cluttered. I know from experience it''s difficult to shoot such objects though, especially when trying to work in their accessories, such as the film reels. Just as a thought, maybe you could place a person in the picture, and have him/her putting the film on the projector or something. Or just try using the rule of thirds, or play with some interesting angles... Hope this helps! :)', '2009-01-29 13:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226084, 760374, 63269, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if fragility has a whole lot to do with silence.... but I love that particular shade of dusty pink - this is a gorgeous photo! :)</td>', 'I''m not sure if fragility has a whole lot to do with silence.... but I love that particular shade of dusty pink - this is a gorgeous photo! :)', '2009-01-29 13:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226087, 759177, 63269, '<td valign="top">The composition seems a little cluttered, but interesting colors.</td>', 'The composition seems a little cluttered, but interesting colors.', '2009-01-29 13:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226088, 759337, 63269, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of depth of field... I think I like it!</td>', 'Interesting use of depth of field... I think I like it!', '2009-01-29 13:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226095, 760221, 63269, '<td valign="top">I feel like this is too tightly cropped for some reason, (but I''m not quite sure why, maybe something to do with the leading lines?)... I feel like I need to see more space on the left of the photo. On the other hand, now that I think about it, it''s a good thing you did crop it nice and tight like this, because it gives a perfectly claustrophobic, imprisoned feel, which, needless to say, matches perfectly with the subject.  So: great shot. :)</td>', 'I feel like this is too tightly cropped for some reason, (but I''m not quite sure why, maybe something to do with the leading lines?)... I feel like I need to see more space on the left of the photo. On the other hand, now that I think about it, it''s a good thing you did crop it nice and tight like this, because it gives a perfectly claustrophobic, imprisoned feel, which, needless to say, matches perfectly with the subject.  So: great shot. :)', '2009-01-29 13:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226099, 760160, 63269, '<td valign="top">Okay, I was getting a little tired of these perfectly symmetrical cathedral shots, but something about this.... The lighting, or the colors, or the tones, I''m not really sure what exactly, makes it look imho a lot nicer than the other cathedral shots. They always seem to harsh and contrasty to me, but this is so much softer and warmer. It almost looks like a painting, and I half expect to see some elaborately dressed royalty saunter into the room. Very nice photo.</td>', 'Okay, I was getting a little tired of these perfectly symmetrical cathedral shots, but something about this.... The lighting, or the colors, or the tones, I''m not really sure what exactly, makes it look imho a lot nicer than the other cathedral shots. They always seem to harsh and contrasty to me, but this is so much softer and warmer. It almost looks like a painting, and I half expect to see some elaborately dressed royalty saunter into the room. Very nice photo.', '2009-01-29 13:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226124, 760124, 61961, '<td valign="top">Strong image.  Very sci-fi.  Is this rmezzo''s work?  I normally don''t like "dropper tool" colored borders, but in this case it fits with the photo style.  Sensory deprivation is an interesting take on the theme (as is covering the ears).</td>', 'Strong image.  Very sci-fi.  Is this rmezzo''s work?  I normally don''t like "dropper tool" colored borders, but in this case it fits with the photo style.  Sensory deprivation is an interesting take on the theme (as is covering the ears).', '2009-01-29 14:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
