(5226443, 759958, 101730, '<td valign="top">Considering the other pictures in the challenge, this is not very original, but I like the execution.</td>', 'Considering the other pictures in the challenge, this is not very original, but I like the execution.', '2009-01-29 18:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226454, 760451, 101730, '<td valign="top">Well thought of, nicely executed, if anything it''s a little too flat, monochromatic.</td>', 'Well thought of, nicely executed, if anything it''s a little too flat, monochromatic.', '2009-01-29 18:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226477, 760410, 101730, '<td valign="top">I like your idea, but I think the background isn''t ''still'' enough: there''s too much going on in terms of trees, lampposts and vans. You could maybe have made the silence a little more poignant by having a lone figure (in baseball/football outfit) leaving the field. Maybe a little lower vantage point. Of course, if it hadn''t been basic editing, you could''ve worked with the colors to make it a feel more deserted, too. <br/>But look who''s talking: haven''t posted a single picture here, still trying to muster the courage ;-) This picture did capture my imagination though, thanks.</td>', 'I like your idea, but I think the background isn''t ''still'' enough: there''s too much going on in terms of trees, lampposts and vans. You could maybe have made the silence a little more poignant by having a lone figure (in baseball/football outfit) leaving the field. Maybe a little lower vantage point. Of course, if it hadn''t been basic editing, you could''ve worked with the colors to make it a feel more deserted, too. But look who''s talking: haven''t posted a single picture here, still trying to muster the courage ;-) This picture did capture my imagination though, thanks.', '2009-01-29 18:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226512, 760356, 102985, '<td valign="top">Great shot! I like this more than most of the other landscape shots, simply because you have someone to ''observe'' the silence. One of my favorites in this challenge.</td>', 'Great shot! I like this more than most of the other landscape shots, simply because you have someone to ''observe'' the silence. One of my favorites in this challenge.', '2009-01-29 19:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226516, 759535, 102985, '<td valign="top">Liked this one a lot... would have been one of my favorites if the colors had been a bit more saturated, maybe with the reds bumped up a bit. But great composition and concept!</td>', 'Liked this one a lot... would have been one of my favorites if the colors had been a bit more saturated, maybe with the reds bumped up a bit. But great composition and concept!', '2009-01-29 19:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226518, 760372, 102985, '<td valign="top">Really like this shot... I wish the light parts were a bit lighter, though.</td>', 'Really like this shot... I wish the light parts were a bit lighter, though.', '2009-01-29 19:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226522, 759318, 102985, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot! I would have scored it even higher if it wasn''t so grainy, and if the sailboat were lower in the frame, not "in contact" with the dark shore. (Of course, I doubt you had any control over that...)  :)</td>', 'Very nice shot! I would have scored it even higher if it wasn''t so grainy, and if the sailboat were lower in the frame, not "in contact" with the dark shore. (Of course, I doubt you had any control over that...)  :)', '2009-01-29 19:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226527, 759738, 102985, '<td valign="top">Great perspective, composition, color range.... wish the image wasn''t so grainy, though, or maybe oversharpened...?</td>', 'Great perspective, composition, color range.... wish the image wasn''t so grainy, though, or maybe oversharpened...?', '2009-01-29 19:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226531, 760236, 102985, '<td valign="top">A little too dark for my taste.... maybe if she were wearing non-black pants, it would be more obvious that she''s sitting cross-legged?</td>', 'A little too dark for my taste.... maybe if she were wearing non-black pants, it would be more obvious that she''s sitting cross-legged?', '2009-01-29 19:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
