(5226588, 760387, 94601, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  Heart wrenching, especially with all of the friends and people I have in my life serving.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  Heart wrenching, especially with all of the friends and people I have in my life serving.', '2009-01-29 20:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226593, 760031, 94601, '<td valign="top">I think a little tighter crop on this would have been nice- maybe take out some of the fence and dead space on the left and right.  But great color/saturation in the sky- brings a nice contrast to the house.</td>', 'I think a little tighter crop on this would have been nice- maybe take out some of the fence and dead space on the left and right.  But great color/saturation in the sky- brings a nice contrast to the house.', '2009-01-29 20:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226596, 760034, 94601, '<td valign="top">It''s a little blown out, and there''s not really a focus point, the duct tape doesn''t quite look like duct tape, except in the highlights.  nice idea (and nice detail in the eyelashes and eyebrows).</td>', 'It''s a little blown out, and there''s not really a focus point, the duct tape doesn''t quite look like duct tape, except in the highlights.  nice idea (and nice detail in the eyelashes and eyebrows).', '2009-01-29 20:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226598, 760385, 94601, '<td valign="top">I like the shallow DOF, and the texture in the bricks.  This is one where I might break the rule of thirds to get symmetry on both sides of the "listener" - with trees and lines going down equally on the left and right of her.  But nice shot.</td>', 'I like the shallow DOF, and the texture in the bricks.  This is one where I might break the rule of thirds to get symmetry on both sides of the "listener" - with trees and lines going down equally on the left and right of her.  But nice shot.', '2009-01-29 20:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226599, 760324, 94601, '<td valign="top">Very pretty. And nice glassy reflection.</td>', 'Very pretty. And nice glassy reflection.', '2009-01-29 20:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226604, 759634, 94601, '<td valign="top">I almost did the same thing!!! But I just put new strings on my guitar, so I saved myself the trouble.  Well lit and interesting angle.  Personally, a bit too much leg in the shot- I may have rotated and cropped a bit, but other than that, good idea and good execution.</td>', 'I almost did the same thing!!! But I just put new strings on my guitar, so I saved myself the trouble.  Well lit and interesting angle.  Personally, a bit too much leg in the shot- I may have rotated and cropped a bit, but other than that, good idea and good execution.', '2009-01-29 20:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226606, 760448, 94601, '<td valign="top">Great expression!  I just wish both eyes were in sharp focus.  Right eye looks great, left eye is soft.  Nice shot.</td>', 'Great expression!  I just wish both eyes were in sharp focus.  Right eye looks great, left eye is soft.  Nice shot.', '2009-01-29 20:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226608, 759929, 94601, '<td valign="top">Leading lines everywhere!!! Nice. Very interesting shot.</td>', 'Leading lines everywhere!!! Nice. Very interesting shot.', '2009-01-29 20:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226610, 760418, 94601, '<td valign="top">Ah yes! I know this moment well. Playing an acoustic song for someone, or even on stage... the song ends... that bit of silence... waiting to see what the reaction is going to be.  Something that i can really relate to. Nice idea, nice shot. (nice guitar)</td>', 'Ah yes! I know this moment well. Playing an acoustic song for someone, or even on stage... the song ends... that bit of silence... waiting to see what the reaction is going to be.  Something that i can really relate to. Nice idea, nice shot. (nice guitar)', '2009-01-29 20:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226612, 760013, 94601, '<td valign="top">Bold statement.  I think whatever is going on at the bottom of this shot could be cropped out.  Just pulls my eye away from a great shot of the face/tape. IMO.  I like it though, well done.</td>', 'Bold statement.  I think whatever is going on at the bottom of this shot could be cropped out.  Just pulls my eye away from a great shot of the face/tape. IMO.  I like it though, well done.', '2009-01-29 20:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226618, 760036, 94601, '<td valign="top">I love that there is one open locker.  It could have been an average pattern shot with it closed, but the open locker makes it look like all the students ran out with reckless abandon- leaving dead silence.  I really appreciate the dead space on the right making the room just a bit bigger/longer.  One of my favorites so far!</td>', 'I love that there is one open locker.  It could have been an average pattern shot with it closed, but the open locker makes it look like all the students ran out with reckless abandon- leaving dead silence.  I really appreciate the dead space on the right making the room just a bit bigger/longer.  One of my favorites so far!', '2009-01-29 20:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226620, 759337, 94601, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  I would have loved to see the whole pin in focus.</td>', 'Great idea.  I would have loved to see the whole pin in focus.', '2009-01-29 20:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226627, 760369, 94601, '<td valign="top">If this photo was tack sharp all across it, I think it''d be a fantastic cityscape shot.  The soft focus takes away from a lot of the pop that this photo could have.  Nice idea and ok execution.</td>', 'If this photo was tack sharp all across it, I think it''d be a fantastic cityscape shot.  The soft focus takes away from a lot of the pop that this photo could have.  Nice idea and ok execution.', '2009-01-29 20:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226631, 758435, 94601, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  The only thing is that the select button, the 4 arrows and the red buttons all caught my eye before the mute.  A closer crop, or smaller DOF could help draw the eye towards what you want people to see.</td>', 'Nice idea.  The only thing is that the select button, the 4 arrows and the red buttons all caught my eye before the mute.  A closer crop, or smaller DOF could help draw the eye towards what you want people to see.', '2009-01-29 20:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226636, 759978, 94601, '<td valign="top">haha. This photo and title (knowing it''s a photo about "silence") made me smile. Very creative and witty.</td>', 'haha. This photo and title (knowing it''s a photo about "silence") made me smile. Very creative and witty.', '2009-01-29 20:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226646, 759837, 94601, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.  I''d love to see the just a bit more color in the cat (either that or a lower angle to get more silhouette), but love how the ground, reflection and the sky all work together.  8 from me. Well done.</td>', 'This is a great shot.  I''d love to see the just a bit more color in the cat (either that or a lower angle to get more silhouette), but love how the ground, reflection and the sky all work together.  8 from me. Well done.', '2009-01-29 20:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226649, 760167, 94601, '<td valign="top">haha. nice title. made me LOL... just a little. =o)</td>', 'haha. nice title. made me LOL... just a little. =o)', '2009-01-29 20:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226651, 760176, 94601, '<td valign="top">handheld shot?  Nice shot, but the lights are all a bit blurry- since they''re the most dominate, it gives the perception that the whole shot is out of focus (even though the cars look ok)</td>', 'handheld shot?  Nice shot, but the lights are all a bit blurry- since they''re the most dominate, it gives the perception that the whole shot is out of focus (even though the cars look ok)', '2009-01-29 20:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226660, 760218, 94601, '<td valign="top">great shot. a little foreground subject, but not too dominating- great sky/clouds/contrast- great reflection- great horizon to separate the water and sky. 9 from me!</td>', 'great shot. a little foreground subject, but not too dominating- great sky/clouds/contrast- great reflection- great horizon to separate the water and sky. 9 from me!', '2009-01-29 20:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226662, 759914, 94601, '<td valign="top">It''s a little blown out on top.  It''s hard with basic editing to get a well exposed field (which you have) and a well exposed sky/white sentinel in the same shot.  Maybe try retaking this closer to dusk to get a more balanced shot?</td>', 'It''s a little blown out on top.  It''s hard with basic editing to get a well exposed field (which you have) and a well exposed sky/white sentinel in the same shot.  Maybe try retaking this closer to dusk to get a more balanced shot?', '2009-01-29 20:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226761, 760451, 98771, '<td valign="top">Can''t think of a thing anymore silent than this. Love the lighting, well done.</td>', 'Can''t think of a thing anymore silent than this. Love the lighting, well done.', '2009-01-29 22:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226766, 760160, 98771, '<td valign="top">I''d say you nailed the exposure, very nice.<br/> <br/>Mac,</td>', 'I''d say you nailed the exposure, very nice. Mac,', '2009-01-29 22:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226772, 760221, 98771, '<td valign="top">I really like this. The tones are excellent, and the hands through the bars, to me speaks volumes.<br/> <br/>Mac,</td>', 'I really like this. The tones are excellent, and the hands through the bars, to me speaks volumes. Mac,', '2009-01-29 22:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226785, 759524, 98771, '<td valign="top">The color contrast between the sky, trees and grass is really eye catching. But, the snow in the foreground kinda'' steals the show. Still a lovely image. Well done.</td>', 'The color contrast between the sky, trees and grass is really eye catching. But, the snow in the foreground kinda'' steals the show. Still a lovely image. Well done.', '2009-01-29 22:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226789, 759063, 98771, '<td valign="top">Do not have a clue how this was done, but I like the concept.</td>', 'Do not have a clue how this was done, but I like the concept.', '2009-01-29 22:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226790, 760246, 98771, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2009-01-29 22:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5226806, 759738, 98771, '<td valign="top">You''ve done a wonderful job controlling the exposure, in what looks to be a tough shot. Very nice.<br/> <br/>Mac,</td>', 'You''ve done a wonderful job controlling the exposure, in what looks to be a tough shot. Very nice. Mac,', '2009-01-29 22:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
