(5226891, 759560, 47294, '<td valign="top">Love the reflection of the tree in the water.  Very nice image, shame you couldn''t bring out the sky a bit more due to the Basic Editing rules I''m sure.  Good luck with your entry 8</td>', 'Love the reflection of the tree in the water.  Very nice image, shame you couldn''t bring out the sky a bit more due to the Basic Editing rules I''m sure.  Good luck with your entry 8', '2009-01-29 23:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
