(5226899, 760036, 25313, '<td valign="top">somewhat provocative. a state of thing and bewildering. you captured alot with the mundane. this could be my favorite. B&amp;W is a perfect choice. 9</td>', 'somewhat provocative. a state of thing and bewildering. you captured alot with the mundane. this could be my favorite. B&W is a perfect choice. 9', '2009-01-29 23:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
