(5227913, 760372, 83080, '<td valign="top">This is a very intriguing photo on it''s own and the title adds to that sense very well.  The orientation feels odd to me as though the petals are falling up as the flower dies.  I hope you''ll share some of the concept behind the way you composed it this way.  It certainly conveys a sense of silence to me and is among my favorites so far.</td>', 'This is a very intriguing photo on it''s own and the title adds to that sense very well.  The orientation feels odd to me as though the petals are falling up as the flower dies.  I hope you''ll share some of the concept behind the way you composed it this way.  It certainly conveys a sense of silence to me and is among my favorites so far.', '2009-01-30 18:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227917, 759832, 83080, '<td valign="top">LOL!  I love it!  Creative interpretation and a nice portrait too.</td>', 'LOL!  I love it!  Creative interpretation and a nice portrait too.', '2009-01-30 18:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227926, 760405, 79141, '<td valign="top">clever</td>', 'clever', '2009-01-30 18:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
