(5227974, 759107, 83080, '<td valign="top">Very effective silence subject.  I wish the focal plane were further forward to sharpen the detail of the front.  As it is I find myself looking at the far sides where it is sharpest.</td>', 'Very effective silence subject.  I wish the focal plane were further forward to sharpen the detail of the front.  As it is I find myself looking at the far sides where it is sharpest.', '2009-01-30 19:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5227975, 760325, 83080, '<td valign="top">Good silence but too much is oof for me.  My eye is struggling to find a place to rest &amp; I wonder if it would have helped to have the near obelisk or the far cross sharp.  Intriguing title.</td>', 'Good silence but too much is oof for me.  My eye is struggling to find a place to rest & I wonder if it would have helped to have the near obelisk or the far cross sharp.  Intriguing title.', '2009-01-30 19:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
