(5228281, 759063, 28882, '<td valign="top">good:  give it to them!  i think after the initial ruckus there may be silence.  nice capture of sparks and smoke.  pretty well balanced image.  clear and pretty sharp. <br/> <br/>bad:  i''d have to say that the lighting isn''t that good.  with the exception of the flash everything seems a little dark.  I think you could have boosted the exposre/brightness a little to show some detail in the radio dial and knife handle.  the sparks are blown anyway, i don''t thing boosting the brightness would hurt.</td>', 'good:  give it to them!  i think after the initial ruckus there may be silence.  nice capture of sparks and smoke.  pretty well balanced image.  clear and pretty sharp.  bad:  i''d have to say that the lighting isn''t that good.  with the exception of the flash everything seems a little dark.  I think you could have boosted the exposre/brightness a little to show some detail in the radio dial and knife handle.  the sparks are blown anyway, i don''t thing boosting the brightness would hurt.', '2009-01-31 00:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
