(5228505, 760324, 67258, '<td valign="top">My favourite of the challenge - a really lovely, quiet landscape.</td>', 'My favourite of the challenge - a really lovely, quiet landscape.', '2009-01-31 06:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5228513, 760405, 100393, '<td valign="top">Fascinating image.</td>', 'Fascinating image.', '2009-01-31 07:06:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5228514, 760266, 100393, '<td valign="top">I really like the concept here but I just want to ramp up the exposure, the saturation and adjust the colour temperature - also, I wish it was bigger. I feel you haven''t pulled out the post-processing for this to be a really great image. I wish you had, it has tons of potential.<br/> <br/>For all that still a 7, by far the most interesting so far.</td>', 'I really like the concept here but I just want to ramp up the exposure, the saturation and adjust the colour temperature - also, I wish it was bigger. I feel you haven''t pulled out the post-processing for this to be a really great image. I wish you had, it has tons of potential. For all that still a 7, by far the most interesting so far.', '2009-01-31 07:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5228515, 760345, 100393, '<td valign="top">The red nail varnish, bracelet and strap marks kind of spoils the image here - a shame really, but I still like it enough to give it a decent score.</td>', 'The red nail varnish, bracelet and strap marks kind of spoils the image here - a shame really, but I still like it enough to give it a decent score.', '2009-01-31 07:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5228569, 758439, 99263, '<td valign="top">Is that a silent protest? I guess so. Nice execution and well photographed but somehow I just don''t get a real feeling of "Silence" from this image. 5</td>', 'Is that a silent protest? I guess so. Nice execution and well photographed but somehow I just don''t get a real feeling of "Silence" from this image. 5', '2009-01-31 07:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5228665, 759785, 47184, '<td valign="top">Wow!</td>', 'Wow!', '2009-01-31 09:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5228680, 759524, 100773, '<td valign="top">The snowy field in front didn''t quite work for me. I think you would''ve gotten more harmony if you had cut that out. The frozen forest with the grass up front and the perfect color of the sky in a greater scale would''ve been perfect. 5</td>', 'The snowy field in front didn''t quite work for me. I think you would''ve gotten more harmony if you had cut that out. The frozen forest with the grass up front and the perfect color of the sky in a greater scale would''ve been perfect. 5', '2009-01-31 09:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5228691, 760057, 100773, '<td valign="top">Love your idea, and the exection too was beautifull. But I don''t like the stereo in the back. Especially not the cables. 5</td>', 'Love your idea, and the exection too was beautifull. But I don''t like the stereo in the back. Especially not the cables. 5', '2009-01-31 09:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5228702, 759833, 100773, '<td valign="top">To long shutterspeed I reckon... Otherwise a nice shot</td>', 'To long shutterspeed I reckon... Otherwise a nice shot', '2009-01-31 09:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5228710, 759318, 99263, '<td valign="top">Very nicely executed image. I love the rich red tones and the fiery ball of the setting sun. Nice silhouettes and the image conveys a good feeling of silence. 8</td>', 'Very nicely executed image. I love the rich red tones and the fiery ball of the setting sun. Nice silhouettes and the image conveys a good feeling of silence. 8', '2009-01-31 09:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5228744, 760115, 103142, '<td valign="top">ok, someone on a forum just went back and review and rescored. So I''m doing the same thing. I really liked this the first time around, but I decided that I really, really liked it this time. I''m wondering if it would have been better waiting for them to go by and getting the bench out of the shot... I keep going back and forth on that...</td>', 'ok, someone on a forum just went back and review and rescored. So I''m doing the same thing. I really liked this the first time around, but I decided that I really, really liked it this time. I''m wondering if it would have been better waiting for them to go by and getting the bench out of the shot... I keep going back and forth on that...', '2009-01-31 10:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5228750, 760218, 99263, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition with a lot of depth and clarity. It conveys the feeling of silence and also tranquility very well. 8</td>', 'Lovely composition with a lot of depth and clarity. It conveys the feeling of silence and also tranquility very well. 8', '2009-01-31 10:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5228767, 760124, 83080, '<td valign="top">Cool!  This is really a fun way to meet the challenge &amp; it has my imagination going wild.  Love the silencing of speaking+hearing.  I hope you have a short sci-fi story to share at the end of this challenge ;)<br/>&lt;bumping up-this is one of my favorites this challenge.  Great creativity &amp; execution&gt;</td>', 'Cool!  This is really a fun way to meet the challenge & it has my imagination going wild.  Love the silencing of speaking+hearing.  I hope you have a short sci-fi story to share at the end of this challenge ;)<bumping up-this is one of my favorites this challenge.  Great creativity & execution>', '2009-01-31 10:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5228787, 759539, 83080, '<td valign="top">Very appropriate subject.  My first reaction was that this was a little oof, but looking at it closer I think focus is fine, but the faded nature of the stones made it feel more oof than it is to me.  I wonder if it would feel less that way if the focus was on the most detailed part, that sculpted circle on the left.  I''m not sure.  Still, a very effective portrayal of silence.</td>', 'Very appropriate subject.  My first reaction was that this was a little oof, but looking at it closer I think focus is fine, but the faded nature of the stones made it feel more oof than it is to me.  I wonder if it would feel less that way if the focus was on the most detailed part, that sculpted circle on the left.  I''m not sure.  Still, a very effective portrayal of silence.', '2009-01-31 10:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5228792, 759353, 99263, '<td valign="top">I guess you mean "Peace and Quiet" It''s a nice image and does convey a feeling of silence. The water is captured nicely and I like the golden sheen and the ripples. If the seagull had been positioned in the lower right corner it would have given the image as a whole even a stronger balance. It would have been nice if the focus and detail on the gull were a bit sharper also. 5</td>', 'I guess you mean "Peace and Quiet" It''s a nice image and does convey a feeling of silence. The water is captured nicely and I like the golden sheen and the ripples. If the seagull had been positioned in the lower right corner it would have given the image as a whole even a stronger balance. It would have been nice if the focus and detail on the gull were a bit sharper also. 5', '2009-01-31 10:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5228808, 760223, 83080, '<td valign="top">Good portrayal of silence.  I might have experimented with blocking light on the child and putting more light on the cat, but then again, this also looks like a genuine moment that may not have permitted much opportunity for manipulating the light.  I like the DOF very much.</td>', 'Good portrayal of silence.  I might have experimented with blocking light on the child and putting more light on the cat, but then again, this also looks like a genuine moment that may not have permitted much opportunity for manipulating the light.  I like the DOF very much.', '2009-01-31 10:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5228810, 759382, 83080, '<td valign="top">This is perfect for this challenge and so cute too.  Love the close composition and the tones.</td>', 'This is perfect for this challenge and so cute too.  Love the close composition and the tones.', '2009-01-31 10:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5228843, 760202, 99263, '<td valign="top">Nice title. What is that? A frozen lake? It does convey a feeling of "Silence" though. 5</td>', 'Nice title. What is that? A frozen lake? It does convey a feeling of "Silence" though. 5', '2009-01-31 10:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5228846, 759063, 99263, '<td valign="top">Nicely executed but I don''t get a real feeling of silence from it. 5</td>', 'Nicely executed but I don''t get a real feeling of silence from it. 5', '2009-01-31 10:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5228847, 760128, 99263, '<td valign="top">There is certainly a feeling off silence being conveyed here and the title is nice too. You might have improved the shot by having photographed from a different angle and not having placed the horse slapbang in the centre. 5</td>', 'There is certainly a feeling off silence being conveyed here and the title is nice too. You might have improved the shot by having photographed from a different angle and not having placed the horse slapbang in the centre. 5', '2009-01-31 10:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5228851, 759337, 83080, '<td valign="top">I love the anticipatory silence this image creates.  I would have been tempted to crop out the bottom smudges and perhaps use a 2x3 portrait with the pin centered.  Having the green ball just off center makes it feel a bit off balance to me.  The sharpness of the pin''s tip is fantastic and it looks like you''re really dropping it (over and over and over... :)</td>', 'I love the anticipatory silence this image creates.  I would have been tempted to crop out the bottom smudges and perhaps use a 2x3 portrait with the pin centered.  Having the green ball just off center makes it feel a bit off balance to me.  The sharpness of the pin''s tip is fantastic and it looks like you''re really dropping it (over and over and over... :)', '2009-01-31 10:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5228860, 760294, 83080, '<td valign="top">Ah, just a magnificent photo.  Honestly, a place like this makes me think of wind sounds.  Still, with such a beautiful composition, I''ll assume it''s a really calm day ;)</td>', 'Ah, just a magnificent photo.  Honestly, a place like this makes me think of wind sounds.  Still, with such a beautiful composition, I''ll assume it''s a really calm day ;)', '2009-01-31 10:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5228870, 760416, 83080, '<td valign="top">Nice concept and execution.  It seems slightly oversharpened from the jaggies on the headphones.  I like the overall composition with some interesting lines/curves to follow around.</td>', 'Nice concept and execution.  It seems slightly oversharpened from the jaggies on the headphones.  I like the overall composition with some interesting lines/curves to follow around.', '2009-01-31 10:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5228882, 759924, 99263, '<td valign="top">The image conveys a feeling of silence but I feel that it would have been more effective if there were less light. It''s too brightly lit for my liking. The feeling of silence would have been stronger if the interior had been darker. Possibly it would have had more depth and been more dramatic also if you had moved back a bit further. 5</td>', 'The image conveys a feeling of silence but I feel that it would have been more effective if there were less light. It''s too brightly lit for my liking. The feeling of silence would have been stronger if the interior had been darker. Possibly it would have had more depth and been more dramatic also if you had moved back a bit further. 5', '2009-01-31 11:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5228886, 759929, 99263, '<td valign="top">Bit cluttered in the bottom right hand corner but does convey a feeling of silence. 5</td>', 'Bit cluttered in the bottom right hand corner but does convey a feeling of silence. 5', '2009-01-31 11:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5228887, 760422, 99263, '<td valign="top">Nice scene that conveys silence quite well but is lacking a bit in contrast. The treetops in the foreground as well as the shadow cast by a cloud detract a bit from the image overall. 5</td>', 'Nice scene that conveys silence quite well but is lacking a bit in contrast. The treetops in the foreground as well as the shadow cast by a cloud detract a bit from the image overall. 5', '2009-01-31 11:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5228911, 760442, 99263, '<td valign="top">I feel you have cropped the tree a bit tight and also there is a sort of "haze'' over the image. It does give a feeling of silence though. 5</td>', 'I feel you have cropped the tree a bit tight and also there is a sort of "haze'' over the image. It does give a feeling of silence though. 5', '2009-01-31 11:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5228936, 760115, 78066, '<td valign="top">This is a really great image, the exposure is dead on and the composition is really nice. I do have to say that I don''t really get the feel of silence though. I hear the sound of crunching snow, perhaps a honk. It''s really pleasant, but not silent. Great image, though!<br/> <br/>_Nathanael</td>', 'This is a really great image, the exposure is dead on and the composition is really nice. I do have to say that I don''t really get the feel of silence though. I hear the sound of crunching snow, perhaps a honk. It''s really pleasant, but not silent. Great image, though! _Nathanael', '2009-01-31 11:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5228938, 760432, 78066, '<td valign="top">Great DOF and composition. The focus is a little soft, and I''m not really getting the silent feel, though.</td>', 'Great DOF and composition. The focus is a little soft, and I''m not really getting the silent feel, though.', '2009-01-31 11:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5228953, 758608, 78066, '<td valign="top">This is a good image, but I do have a little constructive criticism. The horizon is slanted down to the right a bit, and it''s right smack in the center, dividing the plane into two halves in a way that isn''t really working all that well (IMO). There is a lack of contrast as well, both tonally as well as compositionally. Nothing really grabs my eye and leads me through the picture, you know? It''s a little flat. <br/>Keep shooting!<br/> <br/>_Nathanael</td>', 'This is a good image, but I do have a little constructive criticism. The horizon is slanted down to the right a bit, and it''s right smack in the center, dividing the plane into two halves in a way that isn''t really working all that well (IMO). There is a lack of contrast as well, both tonally as well as compositionally. Nothing really grabs my eye and leads me through the picture, you know? It''s a little flat. Keep shooting! _Nathanael', '2009-01-31 11:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5228968, 760345, 78066, '<td valign="top">The lighting really kills this one, I think. It comes across like you were trying to be edgy doing a nude, like that would ''make'' the image (not saying that was you intention or thought, but that''s how the image comes across to me). Compositionally, lighting wise, it just isn''t working for me. : (<br/> <br/>_Nathanael</td>', 'The lighting really kills this one, I think. It comes across like you were trying to be edgy doing a nude, like that would ''make'' the image (not saying that was you intention or thought, but that''s how the image comes across to me). Compositionally, lighting wise, it just isn''t working for me. : ( _Nathanael', '2009-01-31 11:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5228970, 759738, 78066, '<td valign="top">I like your vantage point and all the colors, very nice! It looks a little over sharpened (?), though.<br/> <br/>_Nathanael</td>', 'I like your vantage point and all the colors, very nice! It looks a little over sharpened (?), though. _Nathanael', '2009-01-31 11:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5228979, 760325, 78066, '<td valign="top">I really like the toning and colors in this image, very nice! The tops of the trees look a bit strange though.</td>', 'I really like the toning and colors in this image, very nice! The tops of the trees look a bit strange though.', '2009-01-31 11:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5228980, 759640, 78066, '<td valign="top">I really get the ''quiet'' feel in this one. Great job!<br/> <br/>_Nathanael</td>', 'I really get the ''quiet'' feel in this one. Great job! _Nathanael', '2009-01-31 11:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5228984, 760448, 78066, '<td valign="top">Great expression, the light in the eyes is great as well. The focus is a bit soft though, it looks like you were shooting through a screen door? The texture is a tad distracting. Still a great image though.<br/> <br/>_Nathanael</td>', 'Great expression, the light in the eyes is great as well. The focus is a bit soft though, it looks like you were shooting through a screen door? The texture is a tad distracting. Still a great image though. _Nathanael', '2009-01-31 11:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5228990, 759404, 78066, '<td valign="top">Nice! Really like the "Hudson River School"-esq fade to the background, has a real since of depth. The trees out front are great as well. Great job!<br/> <br/>_Nathanael</td>', 'Nice! Really like the "Hudson River School"-esq fade to the background, has a real since of depth. The trees out front are great as well. Great job! _Nathanael', '2009-01-31 12:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5228993, 760435, 78066, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting! I''m a fan of the stark white background. :D<br/> <br/>_Nathanael</td>', 'Nice lighting! I''m a fan of the stark white background. :D _Nathanael', '2009-01-31 12:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5228997, 760356, 78066, '<td valign="top">Really great image, the composition is fantastic! Have you tried it in black and white? I imagine it to be even more stunning as a b&amp;w. <br/> <br/>Excellent work!<br/> <br/>_Nathanael</td>', 'Really great image, the composition is fantastic! Have you tried it in black and white? I imagine it to be even more stunning as a b&w.  Excellent work! _Nathanael', '2009-01-31 12:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229001, 760442, 78066, '<td valign="top">Kinda cliche, don''t you think? I mean, if you like it, more power to you! But it''s not really jumping out at me. <br/> <br/>_Nathanael</td>', 'Kinda cliche, don''t you think? I mean, if you like it, more power to you! But it''s not really jumping out at me.  _Nathanael', '2009-01-31 12:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229007, 760244, 78066, '<td valign="top">It lacks contrast, but that''s really my only issue with this image. The background is only slightly darker than the subject, so my eye just kind of wanders around until finding the eyes, instead of being instantly drawn there.<br/> <br/>_Nathanael</td>', 'It lacks contrast, but that''s really my only issue with this image. The background is only slightly darker than the subject, so my eye just kind of wanders around until finding the eyes, instead of being instantly drawn there. _Nathanael', '2009-01-31 12:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229010, 759709, 78066, '<td valign="top">Great shot! I like the transition from black at the top down to nearly white at the bottom (cat''s paws). Nice work!<br/> <br/>_Nathanael</td>', 'Great shot! I like the transition from black at the top down to nearly white at the bottom (cat''s paws). Nice work! _Nathanael', '2009-01-31 12:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229014, 759452, 78066, '<td valign="top">Very cute. :D Love the colors and the detail on the fur. Also has that quiet feel, but in a playful way which is nice.</td>', 'Very cute. :D Love the colors and the detail on the fur. Also has that quiet feel, but in a playful way which is nice.', '2009-01-31 12:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229027, 760031, 78066, '<td valign="top">Lighting is a little flat on the building, not a lot to really catch my eye. Maybe shooting at a different time with less direct sunlight it would have worked a bit better? Fence post to the right is distracting in this composition as well. The house, being placed where it is (right in the center) is not giving me a lot of visual interest. Maybe composing the shot so that the house starts at the left (instead of the chain link fence which is just visual clutter) would have brought more attention where you wanted it. At the moment, I''m not really sure where that is. <br/> I hope I''m not being rude! I try to give constructive criticism where I can, because that''s what I like to get on my images.<br/> <br/>_Nathanael</td>', 'Lighting is a little flat on the building, not a lot to really catch my eye. Maybe shooting at a different time with less direct sunlight it would have worked a bit better? Fence post to the right is distracting in this composition as well. The house, being placed where it is (right in the center) is not giving me a lot of visual interest. Maybe composing the shot so that the house starts at the left (instead of the chain link fence which is just visual clutter) would have brought more attention where you wanted it. At the moment, I''m not really sure where that is.  I hope I''m not being rude! I try to give constructive criticism where I can, because that''s what I like to get on my images. _Nathanael', '2009-01-31 12:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229032, 758938, 78066, '<td valign="top">I like the flair coming off the flame, that''s really cool! The pixelated ares around it are pretty distracting though, and the background isn''t going all the way black, which is again a distraction. <br/> <br/>_Nathanael</td>', 'I like the flair coming off the flame, that''s really cool! The pixelated ares around it are pretty distracting though, and the background isn''t going all the way black, which is again a distraction.  _Nathanael', '2009-01-31 12:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229034, 760294, 78066, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning. It doesn''t even look real. The mountains look so smooth and yet so jagged. The lighting is perfect. Amazing, amazing shot. And I really get the silent feel too. Great work, I am impressed! <br/> <br/>_Nathanael</td>', 'Absolutely stunning. It doesn''t even look real. The mountains look so smooth and yet so jagged. The lighting is perfect. Amazing, amazing shot. And I really get the silent feel too. Great work, I am impressed!  _Nathanael', '2009-01-31 12:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
