(5229063, 760168, 78066, '<td valign="top">Great landscape! Not really getting the feel of silence, though.</td>', 'Great landscape! Not really getting the feel of silence, though.', '2009-01-31 12:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229078, 760209, 78066, '<td valign="top">Really cool image! I love the composition and colors. Great job, I really get the silent feel with this image.<br/> <br/>_Nathanael</td>', 'Really cool image! I love the composition and colors. Great job, I really get the silent feel with this image. _Nathanael', '2009-01-31 12:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229116, 759518, 99263, '<td valign="top">Nice enough image if somewhat blurry but it does convey a feeling of "Silence" quite well. 5</td>', 'Nice enough image if somewhat blurry but it does convey a feeling of "Silence" quite well. 5', '2009-01-31 12:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229131, 760388, 103345, '<td valign="top">nice shot.<br/>Chemtrails !! watch your skies America.</td>', 'nice shot.Chemtrails !! watch your skies America.', '2009-01-31 12:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229141, 760036, 99263, '<td valign="top">I like your idea here. The kids are all gone and all that remains is silence. It conveys the feeling of silence quite strongly. The dark part and the light fall at the far end of the image detracts a bit though. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-02-04 15:50:39.</i></td>', 'I like your idea here. The kids are all gone and all that remains is silence. It conveys the feeling of silence quite strongly. The dark part and the light fall at the far end of the image detracts a bit though. ', '2009-01-31 13:04:11.000000', '2009-02-04 15:50:39.000000', 1),
(5229143, 759977, 99263, '<td valign="top">Deathly silence. Nice composition and conveys the feeling of silence well but that large slab in the foreground detracts from the image overall.  5</td>', 'Deathly silence. Nice composition and conveys the feeling of silence well but that large slab in the foreground detracts from the image overall.  5', '2009-01-31 13:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229198, 759636, 99263, '<td valign="top">"their" should be "there" <br/>The image conveys a good feeling of silence and I like the play of light. Nice tones and contrast but overall there is a lack of detail especially in the foliage and the image appears a bit fuzzy. 5</td>', '"their" should be "there" The image conveys a good feeling of silence and I like the play of light. Nice tones and contrast but overall there is a lack of detail especially in the foliage and the image appears a bit fuzzy. 5', '2009-01-31 14:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229438, 760405, 99263, '<td valign="top">Nice close-up shot with good bokeh and it does indeed convey some feeling of silence. 5</td>', 'Nice close-up shot with good bokeh and it does indeed convey some feeling of silence. 5', '2009-01-31 17:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229630, 760361, 100773, '<td valign="top">Would''ve scored extra points with me if there were someone on the bench. Old man with roses or something.</td>', 'Would''ve scored extra points with me if there were someone on the bench. Old man with roses or something.', '2009-01-31 19:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229644, 759914, 100773, '<td valign="top">I would''ve shot this so the treeline was the foreground. The tall grass takes some of the focus away. Then you could''ve gotten a bigger image with more details. <br/> <br/>I would''ve loved to take this photo and used hdr and visited it both day and night. You could try that. Would''ve made one heck of a desktop image!</td>', 'I would''ve shot this so the treeline was the foreground. The tall grass takes some of the focus away. Then you could''ve gotten a bigger image with more details.  I would''ve loved to take this photo and used hdr and visited it both day and night. You could try that. Would''ve made one heck of a desktop image!', '2009-01-31 20:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229649, 759634, 100773, '<td valign="top">This could''ve been a nice photo if you actually held a chord, which you almost do.</td>', 'This could''ve been a nice photo if you actually held a chord, which you almost do.', '2009-01-31 20:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229654, 760223, 100773, '<td valign="top">The cat looks like it''s up to no good. Lovely photo! 6</td>', 'The cat looks like it''s up to no good. Lovely photo! 6', '2009-01-31 20:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229662, 760221, 100773, '<td valign="top">This could''ve been better with a sepia feel instead of b&amp;w. But it''s good, nevertheless! And a great idea. 6</td>', 'This could''ve been better with a sepia feel instead of b&w. But it''s good, nevertheless! And a great idea. 6', '2009-01-31 20:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229669, 759345, 100773, '<td valign="top">Could''ve been sharper and larger</td>', 'Could''ve been sharper and larger', '2009-01-31 20:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229677, 760202, 100773, '<td valign="top">Some disturbing black dots up in the sky. Ruins a beautifull photo. Sorry...</td>', 'Some disturbing black dots up in the sky. Ruins a beautifull photo. Sorry...', '2009-01-31 20:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229699, 759833, 103142, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, I think the picture could be much better. The skin tones look too red, though I like the red in the background and on the bench. It looks soft, and I''m not sure about cropping them off.<br/> <br/>HOWEVER, I gave you an 8 because I think it really speaks to the category! I''ve never given an 8 unless I thought the photo was spectacular. But something about this scene really speaks to me.</td>', 'I''m sorry, I think the picture could be much better. The skin tones look too red, though I like the red in the background and on the bench. It looks soft, and I''m not sure about cropping them off. HOWEVER, I gave you an 8 because I think it really speaks to the category! I''ve never given an 8 unless I thought the photo was spectacular. But something about this scene really speaks to me.', '2009-01-31 20:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229715, 760257, 103142, '<td valign="top">I originally marked this as a 4, because when I first saw it, I couldn''t process it--I couldn''t figure out what it was, and it didn''t hold my interest enough to keep looking at it. Now that I''ve gone back and studied it more--I get it. I moved it to a 5, but even though I like the idea, I would have liked it better if the front part of the image was more in focus, and if the background was darker (without the light spots) to set the image off more. It''s hard when they take dodge and burn away from us, isn''t it!</td>', 'I originally marked this as a 4, because when I first saw it, I couldn''t process it--I couldn''t figure out what it was, and it didn''t hold my interest enough to keep looking at it. Now that I''ve gone back and studied it more--I get it. I moved it to a 5, but even though I like the idea, I would have liked it better if the front part of the image was more in focus, and if the background was darker (without the light spots) to set the image off more. It''s hard when they take dodge and burn away from us, isn''t it!', '2009-01-31 20:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229719, 759177, 103142, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice idea, but with the sky so saturated, and the church so bright, it doesn''t seem very silent to me. I would have liked it better much more toned down.</td>', 'It''s a nice idea, but with the sky so saturated, and the church so bright, it doesn''t seem very silent to me. I would have liked it better much more toned down.', '2009-01-31 20:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229747, 760170, 103142, '<td valign="top">this looked very loud to me. the colors were bright, and there''s too much going on for it to be quiet, so I rated it lower. A city that''s has so much going on can''t be silent. <br/> <br/>However, I was talking to my mom on the phone, and she was viewing the pictures, and she loved it--it was one of her favorites.</td>', 'this looked very loud to me. the colors were bright, and there''s too much going on for it to be quiet, so I rated it lower. A city that''s has so much going on can''t be silent.  However, I was talking to my mom on the phone, and she was viewing the pictures, and she loved it--it was one of her favorites.', '2009-01-31 20:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229768, 759719, 103142, '<td valign="top">I rated this lower, because there is still a lot going on in the city. With that many lights, that much traffic, it''s not silent. It might have worked better for me if the left 1/3 of the photo was cropped out. the skyscraper on the left is almost completely lit, and the preponderance of lights in the lower left gives it a lot of life. without this 1/3, the scene is much darker, the darkest skyscraper has few lights on, and the lower half would be in more darkness--then I might have been more inclined to believe the quiet city.</td>', 'I rated this lower, because there is still a lot going on in the city. With that many lights, that much traffic, it''s not silent. It might have worked better for me if the left 1/3 of the photo was cropped out. the skyscraper on the left is almost completely lit, and the preponderance of lights in the lower left gives it a lot of life. without this 1/3, the scene is much darker, the darkest skyscraper has few lights on, and the lower half would be in more darkness--then I might have been more inclined to believe the quiet city.', '2009-01-31 20:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229782, 760372, 103142, '<td valign="top">I originally marked this low, because I was having a hard time with the flower pictures. They were pretty, but didn''t say silence to me. A scene, like winter and a tree could work, because the scene could also be alive and loud with storms or wind. A flower is a flower.<br/> <br/>that being said, I''m ranking it higher on second look, because you have made a point. flowers live and die without a sound. I''m leaving the other flower pictures as I originally rated them, because they didn''t prove the point like you did.</td>', 'I originally marked this low, because I was having a hard time with the flower pictures. They were pretty, but didn''t say silence to me. A scene, like winter and a tree could work, because the scene could also be alive and loud with storms or wind. A flower is a flower. that being said, I''m ranking it higher on second look, because you have made a point. flowers live and die without a sound. I''m leaving the other flower pictures as I originally rated them, because they didn''t prove the point like you did.', '2009-01-31 20:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229785, 760177, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but I''m afraid it didn''t work for me--I remember these being so loud!! Now if the film had gotten all tangled up and wouldn''t work anymore--no sound, period, I probably would have rated it very high.</td>', 'I like the idea, but I''m afraid it didn''t work for me--I remember these being so loud!! Now if the film had gotten all tangled up and wouldn''t work anymore--no sound, period, I probably would have rated it very high.', '2009-01-31 20:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229789, 760319, 103142, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, I couldn''t rate this very high, because it was so dark, and I couldn''t tell what was in the picture...</td>', 'I''m sorry, I couldn''t rate this very high, because it was so dark, and I couldn''t tell what was in the picture...', '2009-01-31 20:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229859, 760000, 100106, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Makes me want to live there. Really like how both sides are the same and all 4 of the windows are lit up. Nice choice in sepia.</td>', 'Great shot. Makes me want to live there. Really like how both sides are the same and all 4 of the windows are lit up. Nice choice in sepia.', '2009-01-31 21:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229864, 760342, 100106, '<td valign="top">Great choice for the challenge and use of BW. Beautiful shot!</td>', 'Great choice for the challenge and use of BW. Beautiful shot!', '2009-01-31 21:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229872, 760134, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like how all detail is robbed from the Buddha. The silence seems to be imposed by eradicating his mouth. 7</td>', 'I like how all detail is robbed from the Buddha. The silence seems to be imposed by eradicating his mouth. 7', '2009-01-31 21:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229873, 760442, 50695, '<td valign="top">great composition. I love how you''ve balanced the swing.</td>', 'great composition. I love how you''ve balanced the swing.', '2009-01-31 21:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229874, 760221, 100106, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, title and use of BW. Great detail and contrast. One of my few favs for this challenge.</td>', 'Excellent shot, title and use of BW. Great detail and contrast. One of my few favs for this challenge.', '2009-01-31 21:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229876, 759636, 50695, '<td valign="top">I hear a lot of sound and noise in this photo. It''s energetic and chaotic.</td>', 'I hear a lot of sound and noise in this photo. It''s energetic and chaotic.', '2009-01-31 21:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229877, 759407, 50695, '<td valign="top">Feels like sound to me. Cool photo, though.</td>', 'Feels like sound to me. Cool photo, though.', '2009-01-31 21:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229878, 760452, 50695, '<td valign="top">Lovely high contrast piece. Like an ink illustration.</td>', 'Lovely high contrast piece. Like an ink illustration.', '2009-01-31 21:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229879, 758418, 50695, '<td valign="top">Great capture. The silence before an accusation, or a retreat.</td>', 'Great capture. The silence before an accusation, or a retreat.', '2009-01-31 21:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229881, 760036, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like the unbalanced composition.</td>', 'I like the unbalanced composition.', '2009-01-31 21:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229889, 760218, 35321, '<td valign="top">My favorite in the challenge.</td>', 'My favorite in the challenge.', '2009-01-31 21:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229890, 759837, 102024, '<td valign="top">The colors are wonderful.  Very serene scene.</td>', 'The colors are wonderful.  Very serene scene.', '2009-01-31 21:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5229893, 759833, 100106, '<td valign="top">Great shot all around and the title is perfect. The only thing I wish about the photo is their legs hasn''t been cropped off. 7</td>', 'Great shot all around and the title is perfect. The only thing I wish about the photo is their legs hasn''t been cropped off. 7', '2009-01-31 21:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5230033, 758509, 79141, '<td valign="top">stunning</td>', 'stunning', '2009-01-31 23:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5230034, 760209, 100106, '<td valign="top">Personally, one of the best photos in the challenge. Love how you melded the light with the shadows. But the best for me is how you were able to capture the texture of the 2nd and 3rd floors. Saving as a fav and voting a 9. Excellent job!</td>', 'Personally, one of the best photos in the challenge. Love how you melded the light with the shadows. But the best for me is how you were able to capture the texture of the 2nd and 3rd floors. Saving as a fav and voting a 9. Excellent job!', '2009-01-31 23:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5230035, 759709, 100106, '<td valign="top">By far the best cat photo I''ve seen on DP. The lighting, detail, sharpness and expression is perfect IMO. 10</td>', 'By far the best cat photo I''ve seen on DP. The lighting, detail, sharpness and expression is perfect IMO. 10', '2009-01-31 23:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5230542, 758414, 92403, '<td valign="top">cool place to photograph, very creative</td>', 'cool place to photograph, very creative', '2009-02-01 03:48:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5230544, 759957, 92403, '<td valign="top">really like the colors</td>', 'really like the colors', '2009-02-01 03:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5230546, 760152, 92403, '<td valign="top">great sky</td>', 'great sky', '2009-02-01 03:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5230549, 760451, 92403, '<td valign="top">so soft... good concept</td>', 'so soft... good concept', '2009-02-01 03:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5230576, 759982, 99263, '<td valign="top">Silence in Strength? Nice shot of this bald eagle. 5</td>', 'Silence in Strength? Nice shot of this bald eagle. 5', '2009-02-01 04:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5230585, 760388, 99263, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of this jetliner streaking through some impressive looking clouds. Jetliners are pretty noisy though aren''t they? But I do get the feeling of silence that you are trying to convey here. The way one sees the jetliner high above in the silent sky and then sometimes very faintly you can hear the sound of the jet long after it has disappeared from sight. 5</td>', 'Nice shot of this jetliner streaking through some impressive looking clouds. Jetliners are pretty noisy though aren''t they? But I do get the feeling of silence that you are trying to convey here. The way one sees the jetliner high above in the silent sky and then sometimes very faintly you can hear the sound of the jet long after it has disappeared from sight. 5', '2009-02-01 04:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5230632, 760128, 5364, '<td valign="top">You''ve got a nice feel to this and it certainly captures the challenge well but I''m slightly unhappy with the way the dark wall in the background runs into the horses head.</td>', 'You''ve got a nice feel to this and it certainly captures the challenge well but I''m slightly unhappy with the way the dark wall in the background runs into the horses head.', '2009-02-01 05:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5230640, 760051, 5364, '<td valign="top">I like the tonal range you''ve capture here, there are some lovely textures, but the composition doesn''t appeal to me. It''s too tight on the building for my taste.</td>', 'I like the tonal range you''ve capture here, there are some lovely textures, but the composition doesn''t appeal to me. It''s too tight on the building for my taste.', '2009-02-01 05:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5230646, 760372, 5364, '<td valign="top">Your title put me in mind of two things:- A report several years ago that claimed plants "talk" to each other, and the book "Day of the Triffids" where the plants do talk to each-other.<br/> <br/>As for the image, I like the tone of it as, although it''s dark, that seems to fit the subject. My one objection is the petals "falling" upwards which make it a less pleasing image to look at.</td>', 'Your title put me in mind of two things:- A report several years ago that claimed plants "talk" to each other, and the book "Day of the Triffids" where the plants do talk to each-other. As for the image, I like the tone of it as, although it''s dark, that seems to fit the subject. My one objection is the petals "falling" upwards which make it a less pleasing image to look at.', '2009-02-01 05:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5230655, 759404, 5364, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautiful image so I''ve given you a good score.<br/> <br/>As a scene to invoke a feeling of silence it fails for me because my personal experience of such scenes here in the UK is that it''s impossible to escape the noise of humanity - there will always be the noise of traffic, overflying aircraft or people talking. If you didn''t have that here I''m envious.</td>', 'It''s a beautiful image so I''ve given you a good score. As a scene to invoke a feeling of silence it fails for me because my personal experience of such scenes here in the UK is that it''s impossible to escape the noise of humanity - there will always be the noise of traffic, overflying aircraft or people talking. If you didn''t have that here I''m envious.', '2009-02-01 05:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5230660, 760387, 5364, '<td valign="top">I like this. You''ve captured a moment of peace very well. However I don''t like that you''ve cropped off part of the face of the gentleman in the background.</td>', 'I like this. You''ve captured a moment of peace very well. However I don''t like that you''ve cropped off part of the face of the gentleman in the background.', '2009-02-01 05:41:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5230672, 759161, 5364, '<td valign="top">Technically good and a good composition, but I find the necklace slightly distracting. The other thing that bothers me a little bit is the lack of realism - If I were telling someone to "shhhh", my finger would be pressed against my lips, not hovering in front of them.</td>', 'Technically good and a good composition, but I find the necklace slightly distracting. The other thing that bothers me a little bit is the lack of realism - If I were telling someone to "shhhh", my finger would be pressed against my lips, not hovering in front of them.', '2009-02-01 05:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5230773, 760363, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like this very much. I''m afraid that some people will look at the picture and wonder "silence?" But I hope they take in the whole thing, including the title. He''s obviously waiting, and has been for awhile--with the snow gathering. He''s not waiting with someone, moving and talking, or the snow and the hair would be more disturbed.<br/> <br/>The only thing that might have made it better (for this category) is perhaps having him look over the photographers shoulder, or off more to the side, instead of directly at the camera. With him looking at the camera, it engages us, and we''re part of the scene. He doesn''t seem as alone (and silent) that way. <br/> <br/>I still say--excellent shot - 8</td>', 'I like this very much. I''m afraid that some people will look at the picture and wonder "silence?" But I hope they take in the whole thing, including the title. He''s obviously waiting, and has been for awhile--with the snow gathering. He''s not waiting with someone, moving and talking, or the snow and the hair would be more disturbed. The only thing that might have made it better (for this category) is perhaps having him look over the photographers shoulder, or off more to the side, instead of directly at the camera. With him looking at the camera, it engages us, and we''re part of the scene. He doesn''t seem as alone (and silent) that way.  I still say--excellent shot - 8', '2009-02-01 06:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5231090, 759791, 99263, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture of early morning mist rising up from the lake. I like that one can faintly discern the shapes of waterbirds"ducks?" in the background. The image conveys a nice feeling of silence and stillness too. Would have been even more striking if you had posted a version that was larger but still within the challenge boundaries. 8</td>', 'Lovely capture of early morning mist rising up from the lake. I like that one can faintly discern the shapes of waterbirds"ducks?" in the background. The image conveys a nice feeling of silence and stillness too. Would have been even more striking if you had posted a version that was larger but still within the challenge boundaries. 8', '2009-02-01 09:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5231091, 759837, 99263, '<td valign="top">I rather like this shot and I feel it conveys the feeling of silence very well. Has a nice detached, almost surreal sort of feeling to it as well. Not too crazy about the choice of frame for this shot. 8</td>', 'I rather like this shot and I feel it conveys the feeling of silence very well. Has a nice detached, almost surreal sort of feeling to it as well. Not too crazy about the choice of frame for this shot. 8', '2009-02-01 09:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5231094, 760451, 99263, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful shot and I love the lighting and the lightness of it all. I know that feathers falling don''t make a sound but the image conveys to me more a feeling of softness and lightness then silence. <br/> <br/>If the theme had been "Softness,Gentleness or Lightness" I would have given it a 9 or maybe even a 10.<br/>Still it''s very well done and comes close enough to conveying the idea of silence as well to deserve an 8.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful shot and I love the lighting and the lightness of it all. I know that feathers falling don''t make a sound but the image conveys to me more a feeling of softness and lightness then silence.  If the theme had been "Softness,Gentleness or Lightness" I would have given it a 9 or maybe even a 10.Still it''s very well done and comes close enough to conveying the idea of silence as well to deserve an 8.', '2009-02-01 09:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5231366, 760342, 99263, '<td valign="top">Dramatic image that really conveys a strong sense of stillness and is well composed. Good contrast and nice tones. 8</td>', 'Dramatic image that really conveys a strong sense of stillness and is well composed. Good contrast and nice tones. 8', '2009-02-01 10:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5231371, 759535, 99263, '<td valign="top">Nicely executed image which conveys the feeling of silence very well. Nice depth too. 8</td>', 'Nicely executed image which conveys the feeling of silence very well. Nice depth too. 8', '2009-02-01 10:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5231372, 759738, 99263, '<td valign="top">Lovely interior shot of a cathedral with good depth and taken from a nice angle drawing the eye in. Good exposure with nice detail, color and lighting. It conveys the feeling of silence and also vastness very well. 8</td>', 'Lovely interior shot of a cathedral with good depth and taken from a nice angle drawing the eye in. Good exposure with nice detail, color and lighting. It conveys the feeling of silence and also vastness very well. 8', '2009-02-01 10:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5231373, 760115, 99263, '<td valign="top">Lovely image and the blanketed snow conveys a feeling of silence. Good composition also and nice contrast,detail and tones. 8</td>', 'Lovely image and the blanketed snow conveys a feeling of silence. Good composition also and nice contrast,detail and tones. 8', '2009-02-01 10:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5231375, 760433, 99263, '<td valign="top">I like the way you processed this lovely image. It breathes tranquility and also stillness. The feeling of silence is also conveyed here. Very nice. 8</td>', 'I like the way you processed this lovely image. It breathes tranquility and also stillness. The feeling of silence is also conveyed here. Very nice. 8', '2009-02-01 10:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5231377, 760294, 99263, '<td valign="top">One can certainly feel the silence in this image. Very nice depth and clarity too. 7</td>', 'One can certainly feel the silence in this image. Very nice depth and clarity too. 7', '2009-02-01 10:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5231378, 759028, 99263, '<td valign="top">Afternoon nap. Lovely shot with super detail and color. I love the reflection and the patterns in the water. The image conveys a good feeling of silence too. 7</td>', 'Afternoon nap. Lovely shot with super detail and color. I love the reflection and the patterns in the water. The image conveys a good feeling of silence too. 7', '2009-02-01 10:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5231380, 760246, 99263, '<td valign="top">A very nicely executed image with good composition and nice detail. It conveys the idea of silence very well too. 8</td>', 'A very nicely executed image with good composition and nice detail. It conveys the idea of silence very well too. 8', '2009-02-01 10:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5231382, 758973, 99263, '<td valign="top">Nice, simple and effective. Excellent contrast and tonal range. Almost has an abstract look about it. Conveys the feeling of silence very well too. 8</td>', 'Nice, simple and effective. Excellent contrast and tonal range. Almost has an abstract look about it. Conveys the feeling of silence very well too. 8', '2009-02-01 10:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5231383, 760367, 99263, '<td valign="top">Very nice image taken from an interesting angle that conveys a strong feeling of silence and also tranquility. 8</td>', 'Very nice image taken from an interesting angle that conveys a strong feeling of silence and also tranquility. 8', '2009-02-01 10:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5231387, 760452, 99263, '<td valign="top">Nice post processing and the image conveys a pretty good feeling of silence. 8</td>', 'Nice post processing and the image conveys a pretty good feeling of silence. 8', '2009-02-01 10:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5231388, 759382, 99263, '<td valign="top">That''s silence for sure. And peacefulness. 7</td>', 'That''s silence for sure. And peacefulness. 7', '2009-02-01 10:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5231391, 758414, 99263, '<td valign="top">Nice image that conveys the feeling of silence well.  7</td>', 'Nice image that conveys the feeling of silence well.  7', '2009-02-01 10:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
