(5231393, 759031, 99263, '<td valign="top">Impressive image with good composition and striking sky. I notice there is another in the challenge that looks similar to this one and seems to have been taken at the same location. Maybe you and the other photographer know each other and went on a shoot together?<br/>Gives a good feeling of silence. 7</td>', 'Impressive image with good composition and striking sky. I notice there is another in the challenge that looks similar to this one and seems to have been taken at the same location. Maybe you and the other photographer know each other and went on a shoot together?Gives a good feeling of silence. 7', '2009-02-01 10:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5231395, 760152, 99263, '<td valign="top">Nice sunset that conveys a good feeling of silence. 7</td>', 'Nice sunset that conveys a good feeling of silence. 7', '2009-02-01 10:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5231396, 760129, 99263, '<td valign="top">Lovely sunrise..or is it a sunset. Great colors and conveys a nice feeling of silence. 7</td>', 'Lovely sunrise..or is it a sunset. Great colors and conveys a nice feeling of silence. 7', '2009-02-01 10:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5231400, 760044, 99263, '<td valign="top">Impressive image with good composition and striking sky. I notice there is another in the challenge that looks similar to this one and seems to have been taken at the same location. Maybe you and the other photographer know each other and went on a shoot together?<br/>Gives a good feeling of silence. 7</td>', 'Impressive image with good composition and striking sky. I notice there is another in the challenge that looks similar to this one and seems to have been taken at the same location. Maybe you and the other photographer know each other and went on a shoot together?Gives a good feeling of silence. 7', '2009-02-01 10:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5231406, 760160, 99263, '<td valign="top">Nice depth in this lovely cathedral shot. I do feel it lacks a bit of detail though because of what looks like camera movement during exposure. Also the image would have been better without the person in the picture. <br/>It does convey a strong feeling of silence though. 7</td>', 'Nice depth in this lovely cathedral shot. I do feel it lacks a bit of detail though because of what looks like camera movement during exposure. Also the image would have been better without the person in the picture. It does convey a strong feeling of silence though. 7', '2009-02-01 10:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5231408, 760146, 99263, '<td valign="top">For whom the bell tolls. Nice image with depth and it conveys a good feeling of silence. 7</td>', 'For whom the bell tolls. Nice image with depth and it conveys a good feeling of silence. 7', '2009-02-01 10:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5231410, 759093, 99263, '<td valign="top">Would have made a good entry for the single tree challenge. Still, it does convey a sense of silence rather nicely and is a well executed shot. 7</td>', 'Would have made a good entry for the single tree challenge. Still, it does convey a sense of silence rather nicely and is a well executed shot. 7', '2009-02-01 10:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5231411, 760127, 99263, '<td valign="top">The shot is technically very well executed with great detail and lighting and I like the way the outline of the mask and headdress fades away into the dark background. What spoils it for me is the blue strip of blanket that is stretched across the mouth of the mask and the whole frame. I guess it''s meant to imply that the mask is silenced or silent but it somehow does not get that message across very effectively for me and as I said it detracts from an otherwise very nice shot. Maybe you could have used have used something else instead of the blanket to create the effect you wanted. 7</td>', 'The shot is technically very well executed with great detail and lighting and I like the way the outline of the mask and headdress fades away into the dark background. What spoils it for me is the blue strip of blanket that is stretched across the mouth of the mask and the whole frame. I guess it''s meant to imply that the mask is silenced or silent but it somehow does not get that message across very effectively for me and as I said it detracts from an otherwise very nice shot. Maybe you could have used have used something else instead of the blanket to create the effect you wanted. 7', '2009-02-01 10:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5231412, 760167, 99263, '<td valign="top">I like your title and the image itself is very nice too and has an almost "painting" like quality to it. The feeling of silence is also quite well conveyed here. 7</td>', 'I like your title and the image itself is very nice too and has an almost "painting" like quality to it. The feeling of silence is also quite well conveyed here. 7', '2009-02-01 10:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5231414, 760243, 99263, '<td valign="top">Nice panoramic image with strong composition and conveys a good feeling of silence. 7</td>', 'Nice panoramic image with strong composition and conveys a good feeling of silence. 7', '2009-02-01 10:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5231415, 759342, 99263, '<td valign="top">Nice image that is well composed and conveys a nice feeling of silence. Has good depth too.  7</td>', 'Nice image that is well composed and conveys a nice feeling of silence. Has good depth too.  7', '2009-02-01 10:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5231416, 758941, 99263, '<td valign="top">Powerful image although I would have preferred the figure of the man to have been slightly off-center. Also that rock right up against his leg looks a bit out of place in that position. The image conveys a strong feeling of silence and desolateness. 7</td>', 'Powerful image although I would have preferred the figure of the man to have been slightly off-center. Also that rock right up against his leg looks a bit out of place in that position. The image conveys a strong feeling of silence and desolateness. 7', '2009-02-01 10:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5231419, 760262, 99263, '<td valign="top">Stunning image. I love that sky and the silhouettes of the trees on the ridge contrasting so starkly against it. It does not give me a very strong feeling of silence though as the image somehow gives off a feeling of turbulence and wildness because of the sky and the dramatic shapes of the trees. Still it comes close enough to conveying the meaning of the word "Stillness" to deserve a 7</td>', 'Stunning image. I love that sky and the silhouettes of the trees on the ridge contrasting so starkly against it. It does not give me a very strong feeling of silence though as the image somehow gives off a feeling of turbulence and wildness because of the sky and the dramatic shapes of the trees. Still it comes close enough to conveying the meaning of the word "Stillness" to deserve a 7', '2009-02-01 10:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5231420, 759994, 99263, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed image with good depth and clarity. Nice dramatic clouds and strong colors. That palm or banana tree leaf in the left bottom  corner detracts a bit but that''s a minor niggle. The picture conveys a good feeling of silence. 7</td>', 'Nicely composed image with good depth and clarity. Nice dramatic clouds and strong colors. That palm or banana tree leaf in the left bottom  corner detracts a bit but that''s a minor niggle. The picture conveys a good feeling of silence. 7', '2009-02-01 10:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5231421, 760443, 99263, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed image with good tones and nice detail. Certainly conveys what the title suggests and silence also. 7</td>', 'Nicely composed image with good tones and nice detail. Certainly conveys what the title suggests and silence also. 7', '2009-02-01 10:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5231427, 758656, 99263, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and conveys the feeling of silence quite well. 7</td>', 'Very nice composition and conveys the feeling of silence quite well. 7', '2009-02-01 10:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5231435, 760264, 99263, '<td valign="top">Humorous and innovative idea. Nicely executed and conveys the meaning of silence rather well. 6</td>', 'Humorous and innovative idea. Nicely executed and conveys the meaning of silence rather well. 6', '2009-02-01 10:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5231439, 759957, 99263, '<td valign="top">The image is a bit too dark for my liking and I don''t like the cluttered foreground too much. But it does convey the feeling of silence quite well. 5</td>', 'The image is a bit too dark for my liking and I don''t like the cluttered foreground too much. But it does convey the feeling of silence quite well. 5', '2009-02-01 10:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
