(5231456, 759634, 99263, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, lovely tones and good contrast. The title is good and the image fits the title well. But the image itself does not really convey a feeling of silence to me. It does illustrate the saying "no strings attached" very well though. 5</td>', 'Nice composition, lovely tones and good contrast. The title is good and the image fits the title well. But the image itself does not really convey a feeling of silence to me. It does illustrate the saying "no strings attached" very well though. 5', '2009-02-01 10:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5231457, 760031, 99263, '<td valign="top">Nice angle and composition is good. Maybe lacks a bit of detail in the snow. Does convey some feeling of silence. 5</td>', 'Nice angle and composition is good. Maybe lacks a bit of detail in the snow. Does convey some feeling of silence. 5', '2009-02-01 10:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
