(5231462, 759218, 99263, '<td valign="top">Nice capture and conveys silence pretty well. It somehow just isn''t very dramatic or striking overall and might have been so if you had taken the shot from a bit further away if possible to give it some context with it''s surroundings.  5</td>', 'Nice capture and conveys silence pretty well. It somehow just isn''t very dramatic or striking overall and might have been so if you had taken the shot from a bit further away if possible to give it some context with it''s surroundings.  5', '2009-02-01 10:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
