(5231477, 760043, 99263, '<td valign="top">The snow has been nicely exposed and shows good detail but the forest area in the background looks a little flat and can be improved upon by giving it a touch of contrast. Conveys a good feeling of silence and the path leads the eye nicely into the picture. 6</td>', 'The snow has been nicely exposed and shows good detail but the forest area in the background looks a little flat and can be improved upon by giving it a touch of contrast. Conveys a good feeling of silence and the path leads the eye nicely into the picture. 6', '2009-02-01 10:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
