(5231487, 759719, 99263, '<td valign="top">And the city sleeps. Conveys a certain stillness and feeling of silence. I would have cropped out the "busy" bit in the left hand corner some. 6</td>', 'And the city sleeps. Conveys a certain stillness and feeling of silence. I would have cropped out the "busy" bit in the left hand corner some. 6', '2009-02-01 10:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
