(5231958, 760127, 5364, '<td valign="top">Nice enough but I feel it''s a little bit dull - I''d like the white to be a bit brighter and it bothers me slightly that it''s not square, it''s leaning down to the left.</td>', 'Nice enough but I feel it''s a little bit dull - I''d like the white to be a bit brighter and it bothers me slightly that it''s not square, it''s leaning down to the left.', '2009-02-01 12:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
