(5232598, 760452, 28882, '<td valign="top">good:  i like the stark contrast.  the silence is obvious.  the blown sky works very well here.  i think this would be risky entry but i like it. <br/> <br/>bad:  i know there are people that might have problems with this but this is my type of picture.  so my opinion is probably irrelevant.</td>', 'good:  i like the stark contrast.  the silence is obvious.  the blown sky works very well here.  i think this would be risky entry but i like it.  bad:  i know there are people that might have problems with this but this is my type of picture.  so my opinion is probably irrelevant.', '2009-02-01 16:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5232599, 760218, 28882, '<td valign="top">good:  definitely give sense of silence.  i like the reflections, the dramatic sky and composition.  i like the lighting of the boat and clarity of the whole image.  actually quite nice. <br/> <br/>bad:  not much really.</td>', 'good:  definitely give sense of silence.  i like the reflections, the dramatic sky and composition.  i like the lighting of the boat and clarity of the whole image.  actually quite nice.  bad:  not much really.', '2009-02-01 16:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5232600, 760126, 28882, '<td valign="top">good:  good rendering of challenge theme.  i know what she wants.  this is one of those shots that seems to break a few rules in a good way.  also hard to put a finger on it, like the somewhat blown highlights and flat lighing.  i also like the pink hue it has. <br/> <br/>bad:  like i said normally i wouldn''t like the blown highlights like this but here i think it''s ok.  not much i don''t like really. i started out thinking 6-7 but now i say 8.</td>', 'good:  good rendering of challenge theme.  i know what she wants.  this is one of those shots that seems to break a few rules in a good way.  also hard to put a finger on it, like the somewhat blown highlights and flat lighing.  i also like the pink hue it has.  bad:  like i said normally i wouldn''t like the blown highlights like this but here i think it''s ok.  not much i don''t like really. i started out thinking 6-7 but now i say 8.', '2009-02-01 16:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5232601, 758656, 28882, '<td valign="top">good:  meets the challenge well.  i love the muted colors for this type of cloudy shot. generally very nice composition.  i know there not much to the sky but i like it a lot. <br/> <br/>bad:  well the most obvious thing is that first boat with the cropped off top.  i think it really needed to be there.  i think the whole picture needed a wider shot.  other than that not much.</td>', 'good:  meets the challenge well.  i love the muted colors for this type of cloudy shot. generally very nice composition.  i know there not much to the sky but i like it a lot.  bad:  well the most obvious thing is that first boat with the cropped off top.  i think it really needed to be there.  i think the whole picture needed a wider shot.  other than that not much.', '2009-02-01 16:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5232602, 760395, 28882, '<td valign="top">this looks like a film shot.  nice dof and something else i can''t describe.</td>', 'this looks like a film shot.  nice dof and something else i can''t describe.', '2009-02-01 16:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5232604, 759093, 28882, '<td valign="top">good:  i like the composition and solitary feel.  the fog? gives a nice gradient and i like the look of the light through the tree.  the desolate field with  no other objects works great. <br/> <br/>bad:  not to much really.  this is not an outstanding shot but i can''t put a finger on it.</td>', 'good:  i like the composition and solitary feel.  the fog? gives a nice gradient and i like the look of the light through the tree.  the desolate field with  no other objects works great.  bad:  not to much really.  this is not an outstanding shot but i can''t put a finger on it.', '2009-02-01 16:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5232605, 759524, 28882, '<td valign="top">good:  i love the light in the trees and the sharpness of them.  the sky is nice.  this wide crop works good here.  i like the blue part of the border.<br/> <br/>bad:  i think the snow? is too blown.  and the ultra-white border line conflicts with the white of the snow.  overall the image seems a bit dark too.</td>', 'good:  i love the light in the trees and the sharpness of them.  the sky is nice.  this wide crop works good here.  i like the blue part of the border. bad:  i think the snow? is too blown.  and the ultra-white border line conflicts with the white of the snow.  overall the image seems a bit dark too.', '2009-02-01 16:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5232606, 759929, 28882, '<td valign="top">good:  nice and quiet.  i''ve always associated a snowy scene with silence.  nice composition and horizon/perspective lines.   pretty sky<br/> <br/>bad:  i''ve been giving out several "it''s too dark" comments lately, i''m beginning to wonder if it''s my screen.  anyway this looks a bit dark to me.</td>', 'good:  nice and quiet.  i''ve always associated a snowy scene with silence.  nice composition and horizon/perspective lines.   pretty sky bad:  i''ve been giving out several "it''s too dark" comments lately, i''m beginning to wonder if it''s my screen.  anyway this looks a bit dark to me.', '2009-02-01 16:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5232607, 759924, 28882, '<td valign="top">good:  perfect idea for challenge.   i like the low angled shot which gives a little more "awe" to the feeling.  also i like that it was taken from a worshipers point of view.  it makes the silence more personal. <br/> <br/>bad:  the colors seem muted (not necessarily bad though) and the lighting is quite flat.  i don''t know exactly, something else seems off somehow.</td>', 'good:  perfect idea for challenge.   i like the low angled shot which gives a little more "awe" to the feeling.  also i like that it was taken from a worshipers point of view.  it makes the silence more personal.  bad:  the colors seem muted (not necessarily bad though) and the lighting is quite flat.  i don''t know exactly, something else seems off somehow.', '2009-02-01 16:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5232608, 760388, 28882, '<td valign="top">good:  nice dramatic clouds and feel.  interesting perspective.  nice border and clarity to whole image.  the colors are great too.<br/> <br/>bad:  the contrast is a tad strong for me. and overall image is a bit dark.  that''s about it.</td>', 'good:  nice dramatic clouds and feel.  interesting perspective.  nice border and clarity to whole image.  the colors are great too. bad:  the contrast is a tad strong for me. and overall image is a bit dark.  that''s about it.', '2009-02-01 16:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5232609, 760246, 28882, '<td valign="top">good:  good challenge topic although i can swear i can hear the wind at my collar.   i like many of these elements, the clouds and mountains and snow covered ground and trees.  <br/> <br/>bad:  there is some kind of problem for me though.  i can''t seem to find a focal point.  i kind of wander around.  also the whole image is too flat.  i know that comes with overcast but it needs something.</td>', 'good:  good challenge topic although i can swear i can hear the wind at my collar.   i like many of these elements, the clouds and mountains and snow covered ground and trees.   bad:  there is some kind of problem for me though.  i can''t seem to find a focal point.  i kind of wander around.  also the whole image is too flat.  i know that comes with overcast but it needs something.', '2009-02-01 16:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5232693, 759785, 99263, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful photo of this gentle silent giant of the deep. It certainly conveys the feeling of silence very well. I would have liked to see the bottom part of the whale''s tail as well where it fades away into the darkness. Still it''s a very nice image and I feel it deserves an 8</td>', 'Very beautiful photo of this gentle silent giant of the deep. It certainly conveys the feeling of silence very well. I would have liked to see the bottom part of the whale''s tail as well where it fades away into the darkness. Still it''s a very nice image and I feel it deserves an 8', '2009-02-01 16:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
