(5232767, 760057, 99263, '<td valign="top">I guess what you are trying to convey here is that someone has just overdosed to end his/her life and therefore is eternally silenced. For me the image does not convey silence so much but it does convey that someone has attempted suicide and overdosed and is dead or dying. The mute switch in the background plays some role in all this as well I presume. And what is that brightly glowing ball?<br/>Am I seeing the whole message in the wrong context? 5<br/> <br/>Ps. Looking forward to see what your interpretation is and that of other viewers when the voting ends.</td>', 'I guess what you are trying to convey here is that someone has just overdosed to end his/her life and therefore is eternally silenced. For me the image does not convey silence so much but it does convey that someone has attempted suicide and overdosed and is dead or dying. The mute switch in the background plays some role in all this as well I presume. And what is that brightly glowing ball?Am I seeing the whole message in the wrong context? 5 Ps. Looking forward to see what your interpretation is and that of other viewers when the voting ends.', '2009-02-01 17:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
