(5232889, 759422, 99263, '<td valign="top">Ok...I am but I hear nothing...only silence as all the pins have dropped already. But that''s what we want to convey isn''t it? Silence. So in that respect this image succeeds but it does not impart to me the feeling of silence. What it also doesn''t do for me is that it does not hold my attention and all I see are 5 pins of which 3 have part of them cut off by the frame. Also there is too much empty blue space at the top.  4</td>', 'Ok...I am but I hear nothing...only silence as all the pins have dropped already. But that''s what we want to convey isn''t it? Silence. So in that respect this image succeeds but it does not impart to me the feeling of silence. What it also doesn''t do for me is that it does not hold my attention and all I see are 5 pins of which 3 have part of them cut off by the frame. Also there is too much empty blue space at the top.  4', '2009-02-01 17:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
