(5232895, 760126, 99263, '<td valign="top">So many entries that show a person with a finger pressed to their lips. I know it''s meant to imply "Quiet or  Be silent" but the image does just not convey a feeling of "Silence" to me. 5</td>', 'So many entries that show a person with a finger pressed to their lips. I know it''s meant to imply "Quiet or  Be silent" but the image does just not convey a feeling of "Silence" to me. 5', '2009-02-01 17:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
