(5232897, 760421, 99263, '<td valign="top">Lips stitched together and a sad looking subject and a title that says "silenced'' conveys to me exactly that"Silenced" But it fails to convey a feeling of silence to me. 5</td>', 'Lips stitched together and a sad looking subject and a title that says "silenced'' conveys to me exactly that"Silenced" But it fails to convey a feeling of silence to me. 5', '2009-02-01 17:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
