(5232934, 759160, 99263, '<td valign="top">Whilst the image does convey some feeling of silence the thing that I notice immediately is that everything is slanting down towards the right and that detracts from the image straight away.(horizon not level)<br/> Also it would have been better if the whole bridge had been visible instead of the section on the left being chopped off. 4</td>', 'Whilst the image does convey some feeling of silence the thing that I notice immediately is that everything is slanting down towards the right and that detracts from the image straight away.(horizon not level) Also it would have been better if the whole bridge had been visible instead of the section on the left being chopped off. 4', '2009-02-01 17:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5232935, 760319, 99263, '<td valign="top">Looks pretty silent to me but I have no idea what it''s all about or what is about to start. 4</td>', 'Looks pretty silent to me but I have no idea what it''s all about or what is about to start. 4', '2009-02-01 17:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5232936, 758435, 99263, '<td valign="top">Sorry to say but I find this quite a boring snapshot type image of a remote control that has not even been executed very well. Sure if you press the mute key it will switch off the televisions sound but the image as a whole does nothing to convey a feeling of silence to me.  4</td>', 'Sorry to say but I find this quite a boring snapshot type image of a remote control that has not even been executed very well. Sure if you press the mute key it will switch off the televisions sound but the image as a whole does nothing to convey a feeling of silence to me.  4', '2009-02-01 17:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
