(5232938, 759897, 99263, '<td valign="top">Sorry but I fail to see any connection between this image and the challenge theme "Silence" All I see is a pet hamster leaning over some camera lens filters. 4</td>', 'Sorry but I fail to see any connection between this image and the challenge theme "Silence" All I see is a pet hamster leaning over some camera lens filters. 4', '2009-02-01 17:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
