(5232941, 760432, 99263, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry but I cant see how this conveys the feeling of silence. Looks like a one legged sea gull that''s far away from the ocean. 4</td>', 'I''m sorry but I cant see how this conveys the feeling of silence. Looks like a one legged sea gull that''s far away from the ocean. 4', '2009-02-01 17:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
