(5232944, 759978, 99263, '<td valign="top">Good idea behind this image but the brass instruments look a bit out of focus and the image as a whole a bit cluttered. 4</td>', 'Good idea behind this image but the brass instruments look a bit out of focus and the image as a whole a bit cluttered. 4', '2009-02-01 17:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
