(5233076, 760356, 101495, '<td valign="top">LOVE IT! I think you captured this topic, I have seen many photos in this challenge so far(135) and I think to many people focus to much on the "silence" part of this pictur than the actual picture outcome it self. Many ppl had good ideas but porly shoot, I am no expert photographer, far from it, this is just my observation.</td>', 'LOVE IT! I think you captured this topic, I have seen many photos in this challenge so far(135) and I think to many people focus to much on the "silence" part of this pictur than the actual picture outcome it self. Many ppl had good ideas but porly shoot, I am no expert photographer, far from it, this is just my observation.', '2009-02-01 18:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5233080, 759004, 102712, '<td valign="top">I think the composition is a bit crowded and cannot quite see the point. the blue flowers in the foreground are a good idea, but a larger field (wider angle) would have made things more interesting, IMO. Nice light</td>', 'I think the composition is a bit crowded and cannot quite see the point. the blue flowers in the foreground are a good idea, but a larger field (wider angle) would have made things more interesting, IMO. Nice light', '2009-02-01 18:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5233081, 760451, 102985, '<td valign="top">Great shot... actually captures the idea of silence <i>with</i> motion. One of my favorites!</td>', 'Great shot... actually captures the idea of silence with motion. One of my favorites!', '2009-02-01 18:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5233084, 759063, 102985, '<td valign="top">Love it! Sometimes I want to do that to my TV...</td>', 'Love it! Sometimes I want to do that to my TV...', '2009-02-01 18:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
