(5234260, 760442, 98026, '<td valign="top">It is the swing in the piccture that really represents silence to me - yet it is barely noticeable as a result of the sheer size of that gorgeous tree. Still a nice image. I like it</td>', 'It is the swing in the piccture that really represents silence to me - yet it is barely noticeable as a result of the sheer size of that gorgeous tree. Still a nice image. I like it', '2009-02-02 01:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5234262, 760235, 98026, '<td valign="top">Any landscape photo omitting a human element could as easily be "sold" as representing "silence". I just don''t think that it is in the spirit of the challenge. Sorry. <br/> <br/>Btw I should say I have made this comment (or a variation on the theme) on every landscape (there are so many of them) that I could.<br/> <br/>All that aside it is a really nice image - with a simple but effective composition.</td>', 'Any landscape photo omitting a human element could as easily be "sold" as representing "silence". I just don''t think that it is in the spirit of the challenge. Sorry.  Btw I should say I have made this comment (or a variation on the theme) on every landscape (there are so many of them) that I could. All that aside it is a really nice image - with a simple but effective composition.', '2009-02-02 02:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5234263, 759404, 98026, '<td valign="top">Arrrrggghhhhhhh. Another landscape!!!!!!!!<br/> <br/>Sorry. They just don''t fit the challenge for my mind.<br/> <br/>Nice one though</td>', 'Arrrrggghhhhhhh. Another landscape!!!!!!!! Sorry. They just don''t fit the challenge for my mind. Nice one though', '2009-02-02 02:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5234264, 759031, 98026, '<td valign="top">This is a landscape with a difference - it actually fits the theme!!! Hurrah.<br/> <br/>Those boding storm clouds just do it for me. Hope you do well</td>', 'This is a landscape with a difference - it actually fits the theme!!! Hurrah. Those boding storm clouds just do it for me. Hope you do well', '2009-02-02 02:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5234267, 760013, 98026, '<td valign="top">I think the make up is really effective - except - the whites of her eyes are too white.<br/> <br/>Her face (excepting the eyes) really give a sense of fear. It is a shame that something couldn''t have been done to redden those eyes (a bit of chilli maybe lol)</td>', 'I think the make up is really effective - except - the whites of her eyes are too white. Her face (excepting the eyes) really give a sense of fear. It is a shame that something couldn''t have been done to redden those eyes (a bit of chilli maybe lol)', '2009-02-02 02:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5234319, 759792, 99263, '<td valign="top">I can feel the silence of the deep here but I also hear the bubbles escaping from the diver. It''s a very strong image for conveying the feeling of "Silence" but without the diver it would have been even better still I feel. But it gets an 8 from me. Very nice image.</td>', 'I can feel the silence of the deep here but I also hear the bubbles escaping from the diver. It''s a very strong image for conveying the feeling of "Silence" but without the diver it would have been even better still I feel. But it gets an 8 from me. Very nice image.', '2009-02-02 03:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5234320, 760176, 99263, '<td valign="top">This image really conveys the feeling of silence very well. I can feel a blanketed silence where everything and everyone is asleep. No-one about....not even a footprint in the snow. Very nicely executed also. 8</td>', 'This image really conveys the feeling of silence very well. I can feel a blanketed silence where everything and everyone is asleep. No-one about....not even a footprint in the snow. Very nicely executed also. 8', '2009-02-02 03:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5234321, 760170, 99263, '<td valign="top">A very nice colorful cityscape by night with lovely reflections in the water. It does convey a certain feeling of stillness and silence too.  7</td>', 'A very nice colorful cityscape by night with lovely reflections in the water. It does convey a certain feeling of stillness and silence too.  7', '2009-02-02 03:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5234323, 760435, 99263, '<td valign="top">So many "tape over the mouth" images in this challenge. I have lost count.At least you have added the headset which ads some sensory deprivation to the image and conveys some feeling of silence. Also the shot is technically well executed and composed therefore I give it a 6 instead of the 3''s I have been handing out to the other "Tape" shots.  6</td>', 'So many "tape over the mouth" images in this challenge. I have lost count.At least you have added the headset which ads some sensory deprivation to the image and conveys some feeling of silence. Also the shot is technically well executed and composed therefore I give it a 6 instead of the 3''s I have been handing out to the other "Tape" shots.  6', '2009-02-02 03:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5234324, 760325, 99263, '<td valign="top">A deathly silence here. Very nicely done and processed. I like that little sliver of moon in the sky. The tones are nice and darkly ominous. My favorite in the challenge. 9</td>', 'A deathly silence here. Very nicely done and processed. I like that little sliver of moon in the sky. The tones are nice and darkly ominous. My favorite in the challenge. 9', '2009-02-02 03:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5234329, 760124, 99263, '<td valign="top">Very creative and well executed shot and quite unusual too but somehow I just don''t get a very strong feeling of silence from it. Actually I find it difficult to get any particular message from it even though I tried to connect to the title. A little too obscure for me. 6</td>', 'Very creative and well executed shot and quite unusual too but somehow I just don''t get a very strong feeling of silence from it. Actually I find it difficult to get any particular message from it even though I tried to connect to the title. A little too obscure for me. 6', '2009-02-02 03:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
