(5235393, 760013, 63269, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I like the spot-lighted look, how her face seems to just pop out of the darkness. But otherwise nicely done.</td>', 'I''m not sure I like the spot-lighted look, how her face seems to just pop out of the darkness. But otherwise nicely done.', '2009-02-02 15:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5235395, 758973, 63269, '<td valign="top">I like this - the simplicity has a stately sort of charm to it, and helps gets the concept across strongly. The black and white is perfect as well... Nicely done!</td>', 'I like this - the simplicity has a stately sort of charm to it, and helps gets the concept across strongly. The black and white is perfect as well... Nicely done!', '2009-02-02 15:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5235408, 759787, 63269, '<td valign="top">Fascinating use of lighting... At first I didn''t really like the shadow across the cat''s face, but now that I''m really looking at it, I''m beginning to think that it''s interesting. The quality of the light, the elegant blue tones, and the detail you''ve captured are terrific.</td>', 'Fascinating use of lighting... At first I didn''t really like the shadow across the cat''s face, but now that I''m really looking at it, I''m beginning to think that it''s interesting. The quality of the light, the elegant blue tones, and the detail you''ve captured are terrific.', '2009-02-02 15:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5235433, 758578, 63269, '<td valign="top">This looks a little gray and dull on my screen... the highlights aren''t quite white, and the mid-tones predominate. I would suggest doing an adjusment in levels, or perhaps adding a little more contrast.</td>', 'This looks a little gray and dull on my screen... the highlights aren''t quite white, and the mid-tones predominate. I would suggest doing an adjusment in levels, or perhaps adding a little more contrast.', '2009-02-02 15:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5235434, 760115, 63269, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and contrast.</td>', 'Nice lighting and contrast.', '2009-02-02 15:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5235441, 760356, 63269, '<td valign="top">Terrific composition! The color seems a bit drab though, I''m wondering how this might look if you went to black and white? Just a thought.</td>', 'Terrific composition! The color seems a bit drab though, I''m wondering how this might look if you went to black and white? Just a thought.', '2009-02-02 15:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5235451, 760451, 63269, '<td valign="top">This has got to be a winner - what amazing, skillful lighting. You''ve made the feathers look as though they are made of the essense of air, and could disolve back at any moment... Beautiful.</td>', 'This has got to be a winner - what amazing, skillful lighting. You''ve made the feathers look as though they are made of the essense of air, and could disolve back at any moment... Beautiful.', '2009-02-02 15:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
