(5235466, 760223, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love the focus, the scene, the lighting, the colors, pretty much everything. Maybe my only nitpick is the tight crop (I want to see the whole cat) and the distracing clutter in the background on the nightstand. But I love this!</td>', 'I love the focus, the scene, the lighting, the colors, pretty much everything. Maybe my only nitpick is the tight crop (I want to see the whole cat) and the distracing clutter in the background on the nightstand. But I love this!', '2009-02-02 15:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
