(5235523, 760387, 99263, '<td valign="top">Good journalistic type image with sharp detail. Conveys the meaning of the word "silence" quite well too. Well done Toddhead.  7</td>', 'Good journalistic type image with sharp detail. Conveys the meaning of the word "silence" quite well too. Well done Toddhead.  7', '2009-02-02 16:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5235576, 760451, 78066, '<td valign="top">Very quiet, very nice. I like that you went with a bright image, as most are equating silence with darkness. Very nice image. <br/> <br/>_Nathanael</td>', 'Very quiet, very nice. I like that you went with a bright image, as most are equating silence with darkness. Very nice image.  _Nathanael', '2009-02-02 16:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5235582, 760043, 78066, '<td valign="top">This is a nice image, but I can totally hear the sound of crunching snow when I look at it. I really like the lines of the shadows, but perhaps a little more contrast (making those blacks more black than gray) would help the dynamics. Over all, a good image, but not super quiet. <br/> <br/>_Nathanael</td>', 'This is a nice image, but I can totally hear the sound of crunching snow when I look at it. I really like the lines of the shadows, but perhaps a little more contrast (making those blacks more black than gray) would help the dynamics. Over all, a good image, but not super quiet.  _Nathanael', '2009-02-02 16:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5235589, 758941, 78066, '<td valign="top">This is cool, I really like the composition and tones. And, unlike a lot of the shots with a prominent landscapes, I really get the feel of silence. I look at this and I don''t hear anything. Great job!<br/> <br/>_Nathanael</td>', 'This is cool, I really like the composition and tones. And, unlike a lot of the shots with a prominent landscapes, I really get the feel of silence. I look at this and I don''t hear anything. Great job! _Nathanael', '2009-02-02 16:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5235594, 759382, 78066, '<td valign="top">Very cute and clever! I do with there was a bit more contrast though, as the light is pretty flat. But still, great composition and idea. 7.</td>', 'Very cute and clever! I do with there was a bit more contrast though, as the light is pretty flat. But still, great composition and idea. 7.', '2009-02-02 16:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5235597, 759028, 78066, '<td valign="top">The water looks so silky! Great texture there.</td>', 'The water looks so silky! Great texture there.', '2009-02-02 16:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
