(5235608, 759924, 78066, '<td valign="top">It''s a bit cluttered to me. The pews in the foreground, the lights on the ceiling, the wall elements, the alter and back wall decoration, it''s all competing for attention. Adjusting your position, the light, focus, etc, might have yielded a more ''focused'' image.</td>', 'It''s a bit cluttered to me. The pews in the foreground, the lights on the ceiling, the wall elements, the alter and back wall decoration, it''s all competing for attention. Adjusting your position, the light, focus, etc, might have yielded a more ''focused'' image.', '2009-02-02 16:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5235609, 760443, 78066, '<td valign="top">As cliched as this photo is, I actually like it. The towers fade nicely into the background, and the shot is really well composed. So good job on that!<br/> <br/>_Nathanael</td>', 'As cliched as this photo is, I actually like it. The towers fade nicely into the background, and the shot is really well composed. So good job on that! _Nathanael', '2009-02-02 16:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5235617, 760433, 78066, '<td valign="top">I really like the starkness of this image, it''s great! I think it would have been perfect had the focus been a little sharper (looks like a smidgen of motion blur?). Still, great job! I feel the silence!<br/> <br/>_Nathanael</td>', 'I really like the starkness of this image, it''s great! I think it would have been perfect had the focus been a little sharper (looks like a smidgen of motion blur?). Still, great job! I feel the silence! _Nathanael', '2009-02-02 16:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5235620, 759897, 78066, '<td valign="top">Not sure I quite get the image. I had four guineas when I grew up and they were always loud! I do like the way you''ve lit this though, the rim on the whiskers is very nice. :D<br/> <br/>_Nathanael</td>', 'Not sure I quite get the image. I had four guineas when I grew up and they were always loud! I do like the way you''ve lit this though, the rim on the whiskers is very nice. :D _Nathanael', '2009-02-02 16:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
