(5237904, 760345, 100646, '<td valign="top">I can see what your doing here, but I it just doesnt look right. the light is to harsh on her hair and to dull on the rest of her body. also, having just her torso and part of her leg in the shot kind of makes her pose look awkward.</td>', 'I can see what your doing here, but I it just doesnt look right. the light is to harsh on her hair and to dull on the rest of her body. also, having just her torso and part of her leg in the shot kind of makes her pose look awkward.', '2009-02-03 22:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
