(5238351, 760036, 100015, '<td valign="top">WOW! my first top ten and first time in the top 50 i''d say haha, thanks everyone, this is just  random hall in one of my building, walk by it almost everyday, was astonished the first day when i was around a 6.1 (never seen my score go higher than low 5''s) and it slowely crept to a 6.3, but i''ll take it hands down, thanks again everyone for the crit and comments.</td>', 'WOW! my first top ten and first time in the top 50 i''d say haha, thanks everyone, this is just  random hall in one of my building, walk by it almost everyday, was astonished the first day when i was around a 6.1 (never seen my score go higher than low 5''s) and it slowely crept to a 6.3, but i''ll take it hands down, thanks again everyone for the crit and comments.', '2009-02-04 01:41:21.000000', NULL, 0),
