(5238418, 760209, 99263, '<td valign="top">So it''s a courtyard. To be honest with you...I thought it was a tiled floor in a weird room of some kind.That blue object there I thought was a rubber doorstopper with what looks like swingdoors behind it. I thought maybe it was a Chinese public restroom or something and I thought those gray planks that run along the sides was a turnstile or barrier of some kind. <br/>But don''t be surly Biff....anyone can make a mistake with interpreting things hey.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-02-05 05:15:30.</i></td>', 'So it''s a courtyard. To be honest with you...I thought it was a tiled floor in a weird room of some kind.That blue object there I thought was a rubber doorstopper with what looks like swingdoors behind it. I thought maybe it was a Chinese public restroom or something and I thought those gray planks that run along the sides was a turnstile or barrier of some kind. But don''t be surly Biff....anyone can make a mistake with interpreting things hey.', '2009-02-04 02:49:26.000000', '2009-02-05 05:15:30.000000', 0),
(5238433, 760435, 68546, '<td valign="top">This was one of my favourites in the challenge, none of my other favourites scored above six either! I guess I was a little out of sync with the masses when it comes to my view on silence!! Great idea and well executed, well done</td>', 'This was one of my favourites in the challenge, none of my other favourites scored above six either! I guess I was a little out of sync with the masses when it comes to my view on silence!! Great idea and well executed, well done', '2009-02-04 03:00:53.000000', NULL, 0),
