(5238439, 760124, 68546, '<td valign="top">This was one of my top two, I really don''t get the results in this challenge. This is a great shot that fits the challenge better then most others and is technically excellent. You (and many others in this chanenge) were robbed!</td>', 'This was one of my top two, I really don''t get the results in this challenge. This is a great shot that fits the challenge better then most others and is technically excellent. You (and many others in this chanenge) were robbed!', '2009-02-04 03:05:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(5238445, 759107, 39429, '<td valign="top">A very beautiful image of a very beautiful building.  I can tell from your message that this place hold a sacred feeling in your soul for you.  I have often found that trying to share the sacred to a general audience is frustrating and tears at my heart quite a bit.  It has become unusual to feel the sacred through common experiences other than nature, and since that common experience isn''t there, or is even rejected, religious images with a message are often not seen in the depth that they were offered.<br/> <br/>Sometimes in must be enough to know that we have touched the heart of a few.  I can understand the peace and silence of the soul that would come from entering into this place.</td>', 'A very beautiful image of a very beautiful building.  I can tell from your message that this place hold a sacred feeling in your soul for you.  I have often found that trying to share the sacred to a general audience is frustrating and tears at my heart quite a bit.  It has become unusual to feel the sacred through common experiences other than nature, and since that common experience isn''t there, or is even rejected, religious images with a message are often not seen in the depth that they were offered. Sometimes in must be enough to know that we have touched the heart of a few.  I can understand the peace and silence of the soul that would come from entering into this place.', '2009-02-04 03:09:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(5238448, 760124, 101849, '<td valign="top">I was going for a sci-fi silence. I guess not everyone got it. thank you all for the comments</td>', 'I was going for a sci-fi silence. I guess not everyone got it. thank you all for the comments', '2009-02-04 03:12:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(5238450, 760124, 101849, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kevip6:</b></div><hr/><i> This was one of my top two, I really don''t get the results in this challenge. This is a great shot that fits the challenge better then most others and is technically excellent. You (and many others in this chanenge) were robbed! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks Kevip I thought it was rock solid but it was pretty outside the box. Thanks for compliement</td>', 'Originally posted by kevip6: This was one of my top two, I really don''t get the results in this challenge. This is a great shot that fits the challenge better then most others and is technically excellent. You (and many others in this chanenge) were robbed!   Thanks Kevip I thought it was rock solid but it was pretty outside the box. Thanks for compliement', '2009-02-04 03:13:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(5238456, 759837, 49109, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by undieyatch:</b></div><hr/><i> Beautiful work. 9 </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>A bit too late :)<br/> <br/>Thanks anyway.</td>', 'Originally posted by undieyatch: Beautiful work. 9   A bit too late :) Thanks anyway.', '2009-02-04 03:19:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(5238473, 760209, 102925, '<td valign="top">Yeah Chinese Whispers does mean that. In this case, I used the name because it was taken in a courtyard in Chinatown. The whispers refer to the once-noisy, populated yard that now stands silent and empty.<br/> <br/>Thanks to everyone who voted and commented. For better or worse, every comment helps me keep learning and trying to get better.<br/> <br/>Congrats to everyone who submitted to this competition, there were so many amazing photos.<br/> <br/>G</td>', 'Yeah Chinese Whispers does mean that. In this case, I used the name because it was taken in a courtyard in Chinatown. The whispers refer to the once-noisy, populated yard that now stands silent and empty. Thanks to everyone who voted and commented. For better or worse, every comment helps me keep learning and trying to get better. Congrats to everyone who submitted to this competition, there were so many amazing photos. G', '2009-02-04 03:31:51.000000', NULL, 0),
