(5238943, 760246, 39057, '<td valign="top">I agree on the "flatness" however it does seem to be a "quite" scene.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by briantammy:</b></div><hr/><i> good:  good challenge topic although i can swear i can hear the wind at my collar.   i like many of these elements, the clouds and mountains and snow covered ground and trees.  <br/> <br/>bad:  there is some kind of problem for me though.  i can''t seem to find a focal point.  i kind of wander around.  also the whole image is too flat.  i know that comes with overcast but it needs something. </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'I agree on the "flatness" however it does seem to be a "quite" scene. Originally posted by briantammy: good:  good challenge topic although i can swear i can hear the wind at my collar.   i like many of these elements, the clouds and mountains and snow covered ground and trees.   bad:  there is some kind of problem for me though.  i can''t seem to find a focal point.  i kind of wander around.  also the whole image is too flat.  i know that comes with overcast but it needs something. ', '2009-02-04 10:17:02.000000', NULL, 0),
