(5239689, 760294, 27373, '<td valign="top">Incredibly beautiful.  Congratulations on the ribbon.<br/>From Wikipedia <a href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dizin" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Dizin</a> for those, like me, that don''t have a real strong picture in their head of the region.</td>', 'Incredibly beautiful.  Congratulations on the ribbon.From Wikipedia Dizin for those, like me, that don''t have a real strong picture in their head of the region.', '2009-02-04 18:14:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(5239744, 759832, 83080, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by sempermarine:</b></div><hr/><i> Great shot. Very underrated in my opinion. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I second that comment.  This shot meets the challenge, is well done, and it made me laugh.  Oh well, there''s no accounting for DPC scores sometimes.</td>', 'Originally posted by sempermarine: Great shot. Very underrated in my opinion.  I second that comment.  This shot meets the challenge, is well done, and it made me laugh.  Oh well, there''s no accounting for DPC scores sometimes.', '2009-02-04 18:47:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(5239756, 760124, 83080, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kevip6:</b></div><hr/><i> This was one of my top two, I really don''t get the results in this challenge. This is a great shot that fits the challenge better then most others and is technically excellent. You (and many others in this chanenge) were robbed! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I agree.  I was expecting to see this on the front page today and am a little disappointed with DPCers for giving this a sub 6 score.  Hope you''ll keep your awesome out of the box creativity going in the future.<br/> <br/>ETA:<br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by benfica:</b></div><hr/><i> I was going for a sci-fi silence. I guess not everyone got it. thank you all for the comments </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Yes, it gave me the feel of a trial on planet Crypton right away :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-02-04 18:57:16.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by kevip6: This was one of my top two, I really don''t get the results in this challenge. This is a great shot that fits the challenge better then most others and is technically excellent. You (and many others in this chanenge) were robbed!  I agree.  I was expecting to see this on the front page today and am a little disappointed with DPCers for giving this a sub 6 score.  Hope you''ll keep your awesome out of the box creativity going in the future. ETA:Originally posted by benfica: I was going for a sci-fi silence. I guess not everyone got it. thank you all for the comments  Yes, it gave me the feel of a trial on planet Crypton right away :)', '2009-02-04 18:55:38.000000', '2009-02-04 18:57:16.000000', 0),
