(5242445, 760000, 30861, '<td valign="top">Did real well for a first submission. A nice job on a difficult lighting problem too. You asked about emphasizing the shadow of the tree more... Here''s a modified version in Photoshop, using shadow/highlight, levels, and some other stuff...<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=763189" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30861/120/763189.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30861/120/763189.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30861/120/763189.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>R.</td>', 'Did real well for a first submission. A nice job on a difficult lighting problem too. You asked about emphasizing the shadow of the tree more... Here''s a modified version in Photoshop, using shadow/highlight, levels, and some other stuff...   R.', '2009-02-06 13:15:57.000000', NULL, 0),
