(5435149, 760088, 16106, '<td valign="top">My thoughts were "The silence of the grave" and few moments in life tend to be less full of chatter than when you are putting flowers, or dirt onto the coffin of a friend.<br/> <br/>As far a getting a different angle, I didn''t feel it was appropriate to jump down onto the coffin.</td>', 'My thoughts were "The silence of the grave" and few moments in life tend to be less full of chatter than when you are putting flowers, or dirt onto the coffin of a friend. As far a getting a different angle, I didn''t feel it was appropriate to jump down onto the coffin.', '2009-04-13 16:23:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(5540816, 759640, 100773, '<td valign="top">Maybe the dots would''ve been less distracting had you used a smaller aperture. I think you easily could''ve used f/11 and ISO 400 with your D80, awesome camera when it comes to noise =) Now I do understand the dots though... I didn''t get it when I was voting... SORRY!!</td>', 'Maybe the dots would''ve been less distracting had you used a smaller aperture. I think you easily could''ve used f/11 and ISO 400 with your D80, awesome camera when it comes to noise =) Now I do understand the dots though... I didn''t get it when I was voting... SORRY!!', '2009-06-23 11:56:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5540841, 759640, 106136, '<td valign="top">I love it. For those who don''t ge "the dots"....it''s an ellipsis!  .....these overused dots that suggest that some of the quote has been left out....or a break in thought....lol.</td>', 'I love it. For those who don''t ge "the dots"....it''s an ellipsis!  .....these overused dots that suggest that some of the quote has been left out....or a break in thought....lol.', '2009-06-23 12:27:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(5541073, 759640, 102734, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by BJamy:</b></div><hr/><i> Maybe the dots would''ve been less distracting had you used a smaller aperture. I think you easily could''ve used f/11 and ISO 400 with your D80, awesome camera when it comes to noise =) Now I do understand the dots though... I didn''t get it when I was voting... SORRY!! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Relax man, i think i would have to put my ideas more clearly the next time.<br/>I love D80, it works great for me.<br/>Thanks for your words.</td>', 'Originally posted by BJamy: Maybe the dots would''ve been less distracting had you used a smaller aperture. I think you easily could''ve used f/11 and ISO 400 with your D80, awesome camera when it comes to noise =) Now I do understand the dots though... I didn''t get it when I was voting... SORRY!!   Relax man, i think i would have to put my ideas more clearly the next time.I love D80, it works great for me.Thanks for your words.', '2009-06-23 16:05:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5541075, 759640, 102734, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by cjgorman:</b></div><hr/><i> I love it. For those who don''t ge "the dots"....it''s an ellipsis!  .....these overused dots that suggest that some of the quote has been left out....or a break in thought....lol. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yeah... hahahaha</td>', 'Originally posted by cjgorman: I love it. For those who don''t ge "the dots"....it''s an ellipsis!  .....these overused dots that suggest that some of the quote has been left out....or a break in thought....lol.   Yeah... hahahaha', '2009-06-23 16:05:44.000000', NULL, 0),
